{"move","{\"pound\":{\"name\":\"Pound\",\"effect\":\"The target is physically pounded with a long tail, a foreleg, or the like.\"},\"karateChop\":{\"name\":\"Karate Chop\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with a sharp chop. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"doubleSlap\":{\"name\":\"Double Slap\",\"effect\":\"The target is slapped repeatedly, back and forth, 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"cometPunch\":{\"name\":\"Comet Punch\",\"effect\":\"The target is hit with a flurry of punches that strike 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"megaPunch\":{\"name\":\"Mega Punch\",\"effect\":\"The target is slugged by a punch thrown with muscle-packed power.\"},\"payDay\":{\"name\":\"Pay Day\",\"effect\":\"Coins are hurled at the target to inflict damage. If the target is successfully struck, you will earn money after the battle.\"},\"firePunch\":{\"name\":\"Fire Punch\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with a fiery punch. This move has a 10% chance of burning the target.\"},\"icePunch\":{\"name\":\"Ice Punch\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with an icy punch. This move has a 10% chance of freezing the target.\"},\"thunderPunch\":{\"name\":\"Thunder Punch\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with an electrified punch. This move has a 10% chance of paralyzing the target.\"},\"scratch\":{\"name\":\"Scratch\",\"effect\":\"Hard, pointed, sharp claws rake the target to inflict damage.\"},\"viseGrip\":{\"name\":\"Vise Grip\",\"effect\":\"The target is gripped and squeezed from both sides to inflict damage.\"},\"guillotine\":{\"name\":\"Guillotine\",\"effect\":\"A vicious, tearing attack with big pincers. The target faints instantly if this attack hits, unless it is a Boss Pok\u00e9mon. The accuracy of this move is fixed at 30%.\"},\"razorWind\":{\"name\":\"Razor Wind\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the turn after using this move with blades of wind. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"swordsDance\":{\"name\":\"Swords Dance\",\"effect\":\"A frenetic dance to uplift the fighting spirit. This sharply boosts the user\u2019s Attack stat.\"},\"cut\":{\"name\":\"Cut\",\"effect\":\"The target is cut with a scythe, a claw, or the like to inflict damage.\"},\"gust\":{\"name\":\"Gust\",\"effect\":\"A gust of wind is whipped up by wings and launched at the target to inflict damage. This move can hit a target that\u2019s in the air from Fly, Bounce, or Sky Drop with its power doubled.\"},\"wingAttack\":{\"name\":\"Wing Attack\",\"effect\":\"The target is struck with large, imposing wings spread wide to inflict damage.\"},\"whirlwind\":{\"name\":\"Whirlwind\",\"effect\":\"The user moves last and creates a strong wind. The target is blown away, and a different Pok\u00e9mon is dragged out. In the wild, this ends a battle against a single Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"fly\":{\"name\":\"Fly\",\"effect\":\"The user flies up into the sky on the first turn, then attacks on the next turn.\"},\"bind\":{\"name\":\"Bind\",\"effect\":\"A long body, tentacles, or the like are used to bind and squeeze the target. For 4-5 turns, the target takes damage equal to \u215b of its max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"slam\":{\"name\":\"Slam\",\"effect\":\"The target is slammed with a long tail, vines, or the like to inflict damage.\"},\"vineWhip\":{\"name\":\"Vine Whip\",\"effect\":\"The target is struck with slender, whiplike vines to inflict damage.\"},\"stomp\":{\"name\":\"Stomp\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by stomping on the target with a big foot. This move has a 30% chance of making the target flinch. If the target has used Minimize, this move\u2019s power is doubled and it will be sure to hit.\"},\"doubleKick\":{\"name\":\"Double Kick\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by kicking the target twice in a row using two feet.\"},\"megaKick\":{\"name\":\"Mega Kick\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked by a kick launched with muscle-packed power.\"},\"jumpKick\":{\"name\":\"Jump Kick\",\"effect\":\"The user jumps up high, then strikes with a kick. If this move misses or fails, the user takes damage equal to \u00bd of its max HP.\"},\"rollingKick\":{\"name\":\"Rolling Kick\",\"effect\":\"The user lashes out with a quick, spinning kick. This move has a 30% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"sandAttack\":{\"name\":\"Sand Attack\",\"effect\":\"Sand is hurled in the target\u2019s face, lowering the target\u2019s accuracy.\"},\"headbutt\":{\"name\":\"Headbutt\",\"effect\":\"The user sticks out its head and attacks by charging straight into the target. This move has a 30% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"hornAttack\":{\"name\":\"Horn Attack\",\"effect\":\"The target is jabbed with a sharply pointed horn to inflict damage.\"},\"furyAttack\":{\"name\":\"Fury Attack\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by jabbing the target with a horn, a beak, or the like. This move hits 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"hornDrill\":{\"name\":\"Horn Drill\",\"effect\":\"The user stabs the target with a horn that rotates like a drill. The target faints instantly if this attack hits, unless it is a Boss Pok\u00e9mon. The accuracy of this move is fixed at 30%.\"},\"tackle\":{\"name\":\"Tackle\",\"effect\":\"A physical attack in which the user charges and slams into the target with its whole body.\"},\"bodySlam\":{\"name\":\"Body Slam\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by dropping onto the target with its full body weight. This move has a 30% chance of paralyzing the target. If the target has used Minimize, this move\u2019s power is doubled and it will be sure to hit.\"},\"wrap\":{\"name\":\"Wrap\",\"effect\":\"A long body, vines, or the like are used to wrap and squeeze the target. For 4-5 turns, the target takes damage equal to \u215b of its max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"takeDown\":{\"name\":\"Take Down\",\"effect\":\"A reckless full-body charge attack for slamming into the target. The user takes \u00bc of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"thrash\":{\"name\":\"Thrash\",\"effect\":\"The user rampages and attacks for 2-3 turns. The user then becomes confused.\"},\"doubleEdge\":{\"name\":\"Double-Edge\",\"effect\":\"A reckless life-risking tackle in which the user rushes the target. The user takes \u2153 of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"tailWhip\":{\"name\":\"Tail Whip\",\"effect\":\"The user wags its tail cutely, making opposing Pok\u00e9mon less wary. This lowers their Defense stats.\"},\"poisonSting\":{\"name\":\"Poison Sting\",\"effect\":\"The user stabs the target with a poisonous stinger to inflict damage. This move has a 30% chance of poisoning the target.\"},\"twineedle\":{\"name\":\"Twineedle\",\"effect\":\"The user damages the target twice in succession by jabbing it with two spikes. Each hit has a 20% chance of poisoning the target.\"},\"pinMissile\":{\"name\":\"Pin Missile\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by shooting sharp spikes at the target. This move hits 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"leer\":{\"name\":\"Leer\",\"effect\":\"The user gives opposing Pok\u00e9mon an intimidating leer that lowers their Defense stats.\"},\"bite\":{\"name\":\"Bite\",\"effect\":\"The target is bitten with viciously sharp fangs. This move has a 30% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"growl\":{\"name\":\"Growl\",\"effect\":\"The user growls in an endearing way, making opposing Pok\u00e9mon less wary. This lowers their Attack stats.\"},\"roar\":{\"name\":\"Roar\",\"effect\":\"The user moves last and lets out a mighty roar. The target is scared off, and a different Pok\u00e9mon is dragged out. In the wild, this ends a battle against a single Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"sing\":{\"name\":\"Sing\",\"effect\":\"A soothing lullaby is sung in a beautiful voice that puts the target to sleep.\"},\"supersonic\":{\"name\":\"Supersonic\",\"effect\":\"The user generates odd sound waves from its body that confuse the target.\"},\"sonicBoom\":{\"name\":\"Sonic Boom\",\"effect\":\"The target is hit with a destructive shock wave that always inflicts 20 HP damage.\"},\"disable\":{\"name\":\"Disable\",\"effect\":\"For 4 turns, the target will be unable to use whichever move it last used.\"},\"acid\":{\"name\":\"Acid\",\"effect\":\"Opposing Pok\u00e9mon are attacked with a spray of harsh acid. This move has a 10% chance of lowering their Sp. Def stats.\"},\"ember\":{\"name\":\"Ember\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with small flames. This move has a 10% chance of burning the target.\"},\"flamethrower\":{\"name\":\"Flamethrower\",\"effect\":\"The target is scorched with an intense blast of fire. This move has a 10% chance of burning the target.\"},\"mist\":{\"name\":\"Mist\",\"effect\":\"The user cloaks itself and its allies in a white mist that prevents any of their stats from being lowered for 5 turns.\"},\"waterGun\":{\"name\":\"Water Gun\",\"effect\":\"The target is blasted with a forceful shot of water.\"},\"hydroPump\":{\"name\":\"Hydro Pump\",\"effect\":\"The target is blasted by a huge volume of water launched under great pressure.\"},\"surf\":{\"name\":\"Surf\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks everything around it by swamping its surroundings with a giant wave. This move\u2019s power is doubled against targets submerged with Dive.\"},\"iceBeam\":{\"name\":\"Ice Beam\",\"effect\":\"The target is struck with an icy-cold beam of energy. This move has a 10% chance of freezing the target.\"},\"blizzard\":{\"name\":\"Blizzard\",\"effect\":\"A howling blizzard is summoned to strike opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This move has a 10% chance of freezing targets and never misses in snow or hail.\"},\"psybeam\":{\"name\":\"Psybeam\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with a peculiar ray. This move has a 10% chance of confusing the target.\"},\"bubbleBeam\":{\"name\":\"Bubble Beam\",\"effect\":\"A spray of bubbles is forcefully ejected at the target. This move has a 10% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Speed stat.\"},\"auroraBeam\":{\"name\":\"Aurora Beam\",\"effect\":\"The target is hit with a rainbow-colored beam. This move has a 10% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Attack stat.\"},