t opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"solarBeam\":{\"name\":\"Solar Beam\",\"effect\":\"The user gathers light on the first turn, then blasts a bundled beam on the next turn. In harsh sunlight, the user can attack immediately. This move\u2019s power is halved in any other weather condition.\"},\"poisonPowder\":{\"name\":\"Poison Powder\",\"effect\":\"The user scatters a cloud of poisonous dust that poisons the target. Grass-type Pok\u00e9mon are unaffected.\"},\"stunSpore\":{\"name\":\"Stun Spore\",\"effect\":\"The user scatters a cloud of numbing powder that paralyzes the target. Grass-type Pok\u00e9mon are unaffected.\"},\"sleepPowder\":{\"name\":\"Sleep Powder\",\"effect\":\"The user scatters a cloud of soporific dust that puts the target to sleep. Grass-type Pok\u00e9mon are unaffected.\"},\"petalDance\":{\"name\":\"Petal Dance\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target by scattering petals for 2-3 turns. The user then becomes confused.\"},\"stringShot\":{\"name\":\"String Shot\",\"effect\":\"The user blows silk from its mouth that binds opposing Pok\u00e9mon and harshly lowers their Speed stat.\"},\"dragonRage\":{\"name\":\"Dragon Rage\",\"effect\":\"This attack hits the target with a shock wave of pure rage. This attack always inflicts 40 HP damage.\"},\"fireSpin\":{\"name\":\"Fire Spin\",\"effect\":\"The user traps the target inside a fierce vortex of fire. For 4-5 turns, the target takes damage equal to \u215b of its max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"thunderShock\":{\"name\":\"Thunder Shock\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with a jolt of electricity. This move has a 10% chance of paralyzing the target.\"},\"thunderbolt\":{\"name\":\"Thunderbolt\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with a strong electric blast. This move has a 10% chance of paralyzing the target.\"},\"thunderWave\":{\"name\":\"Thunder Wave\",\"effect\":\"The user launches a weak jolt of electricity that paralyzes the target. Ground-type Pok\u00e9mon are unaffected.\"},\"thunder\":{\"name\":\"Thunder\",\"effect\":\"A wicked thunderbolt is dropped on the target to inflict damage. This move has a 30% chance of paralyzing the target and never misses in rain. In harsh sunlight, this move\u2019s accuracy is 50%. This move can hit a target that\u2019s in the air from Fly, Bounce, or Sky Drop.\"},\"rockThrow\":{\"name\":\"Rock Throw\",\"effect\":\"The user picks up and throws a small rock at the target to inflict damage.\"},\"earthquake\":{\"name\":\"Earthquake\",\"effect\":\"The user sets off an earthquake that strikes every Pok\u00e9mon around it. This move\u2019s power is doubled against targets underground from Dig, and halved while Grassy Terrain is active.\"},\"fissure\":{\"name\":\"Fissure\",\"effect\":\"The user opens up a fissure in the ground and drops the target in. The target faints instantly if this attack hits, unless it is a Boss Pok\u00e9mon. The accuracy of this move is fixed at 30%.\"},\"dig\":{\"name\":\"Dig\",\"effect\":\"The user burrows into the ground on the first turn, then attacks on the next turn.\"},\"toxic\":{\"name\":\"Toxic\",\"effect\":\"A move that leaves the target badly poisoned. The target takes increasing poison damage at the end of every turn, starting at \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s max HP, then \u00b2\u2044\u2081\u2086 and so on. If the user is a Poison-type, this move will never miss.\"},\"confusion\":{\"name\":\"Confusion\",\"effect\":\"The target is hit with a weak telekinetic force to inflict damage. This move has a 10% chance of confusing the target.\"},\"psychic\":{\"name\":\"Psychic\",\"effect\":\"The target is hit with a strong telekinetic force to inflict damage. This move has a 10% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"hypnosis\":{\"name\":\"Hypnosis\",\"effect\":\"The user employs hypnotic suggestion to make the target fall asleep.\"},\"meditate\":{\"name\":\"Meditate\",\"effect\":\"The user meditates to awaken the power deep within its body to boost the user\u2019s Attack stat.\"},\"agility\":{\"name\":\"Agility\",\"effect\":\"The user relaxes and lightens its body to move faster. This sharply boosts its Speed stat.\"},\"quickAttack\":{\"name\":\"Quick Attack\",\"effect\":\"The user lunges at the target to inflict damage, moving at blinding speed. This move always goes first.\"},\"rage\":{\"name\":\"Rage\",\"effect\":\"As long as this move is in use, the power of rage boosts the Attack stat each time the user is hit in battle.\"},\"teleport\":{\"name\":\"Teleport\",\"effect\":\"The user moves last and switches places with a party Pok\u00e9mon in waiting, if any. If a wild Pok\u00e9mon uses this move, it flees.\"},\"nightShade\":{\"name\":\"Night Shade\",\"effect\":\"The user makes the target see a frightening mirage. It inflicts damage equal to the user\u2019s level.\"},\"mimic\":{\"name\":\"Mimic\",\"effect\":\"The user copies the move last used by the target. The copied move can be used until the user of Mimic leaves the battle.\"},\"screech\":{\"name\":\"Screech\",\"effect\":\"An earsplitting screech harshly lowers the target\u2019s Defense stat.\"},\"doubleTeam\":{\"name\":\"Double Team\",\"effect\":\"By moving rapidly, the user makes illusory copies of itself to boost its evasiveness.\"},\"recover\":{\"name\":\"Recover\",\"effect\":\"The user regenerates its cells, restoring \u00bd of its max HP.\"},\"harden\":{\"name\":\"Harden\",\"effect\":\"The user stiffens all the muscles in its body to boost its Defense stat.\"},\"minimize\":{\"name\":\"Minimize\",\"effect\":\"The user compresses its body to make itself look smaller, which sharply boosts its evasiveness. However, this leaves the user more vulnerable to certain slamming and crushing moves.\"},\"smokescreen\":{\"name\":\"Smokescreen\",\"effect\":\"The user releases an obscuring cloud of smoke or ink. This lowers the target\u2019s accuracy.\"},\"confuseRay\":{\"name\":\"Confuse Ray\",\"effect\":\"The user shines a sinister ray at the target, leaving it confused.\"},\"withdraw\":{\"name\":\"Withdraw\",\"effect\":\"The user withdraws its body into its hard shell, boosting its Defense stat.\"},\"defenseCurl\":{\"name\":\"Defense Curl\",\"effect\":\"The user curls up to conceal weak spots, which boosts its Defense stat. This also doubles the power of Rollout and Ice Ball.\"},\"barrier\":{\"name\":\"Barrier\",\"effect\":\"The user throws up a sturdy wall that sharply boosts its Defense stat.\"},\"lightScreen\":{\"name\":\"Light Screen\",\"effect\":\"A wondrous wall of light is put up to halve the damage taken from special moves for 5 turns. In Double Battles, this damage is reduced by \u2153 instead.\"},\"haze\":{\"name\":\"Haze\",\"effect\":\"The user creates a haze that eliminates every stat change among all the Pok\u00e9mon engaged in battle.\"},\"reflect\":{\"name\":\"Reflect\",\"effect\":\"A wondrous wall of light is put up to halve the damage taken from physical moves for 5 turns. In Double Battles, this damage is reduced by \u2153 instead.\"},\"focusEnergy\":{\"name\":\"Focus Energy\",\"effect\":\"The user takes a deep breath and focuses, gaining a 2-stage critical-hit ratio boost to its future attacks.\"},\"bide\":{\"name\":\"Bide\",\"effect\":\"The user endures attacks for 2 turns, then strikes back to cause double the damage taken.\"},\"metronome\":{\"name\":\"Metronome\",\"effect\":\"The user waggles a finger and stimulates its brain into randomly using nearly any move.\"},\"mirrorMove\":{\"name\":\"Mirror Move\",\"effect\":\"The user counters the target by mimicking the target\u2019s last move. This move fails if no other move has been used yet, or if the last move used cannot be copied.\"},\"selfDestruct\":{\"name\":\"Self-Destruct\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks everything around it by causing an explosion. The user faints upon using this move.\"},\"eggBomb\":{\"name\":\"Egg Bomb\",\"effect\":\"A large egg is hurled at the target with maximum force to inflict damage.\"},\"lick\":{\"name\":\"Lick\",\"effect\":\"The user licks the target with a long tongue to inflict damage. This move has a 30% chance of paralyzing the target.\"},\"smog\":{\"name\":\"Smog\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with a discharge of filthy gases. This move has a 40% chance of poisoning the target.\"},\"sludge\":{\"name\":\"Sludge\",\"effect\":\"The user hurls unsanitary sludge at the target to inflict damage. This move has a 30% chance of poisoning the target.\"},\"boneClub\":{\"name\":\"Bone Club\",\"effect\":\"The user clubs the target with a bone. This move has a 10% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"fireBlast\":{\"name\":\"Fire Blast\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with an intense blast of all-consuming fire. This move has a 10% chance of burning the target.\"},\"waterfall\":{\"name\":\"Waterfall\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by charging at the target with incredible momentum. This move has a 20% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"clamp\":{\"name\":\"Clamp\",\"effect\":\"The target is clamped and squeezed by the user\u2019s very thick and sturdy shell. For 4-5 turns, the target takes damage equal to \u215b of its max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"swift\":{\"name\":\"Swift\",\"effect\":\"Star-shaped rays are shot at opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This attack never misses.\"},\"skullBash\":{\"name\":\"Skull Bash\",\"effect\":\"The user tucks in its head to boost its Defense stat on the first turn, then rams the target on the next turn.\"},\"spikeCannon\":{\"name\":\"Spike Cannon\",\"effect\":\"Sharp spikes are shot at the target in rapid succession. They hit 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"constrict\":{\"name\":\"Constrict\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with long, creeping tentacles, vines, or the like. This move has a 10% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Speed stat.\"},\"amnesia\":{\"name\":\"Amnesia\",\"effect\":\"The user temporarily empties its mind to forget its concerns. This sharply boosts the user\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"kinesis\":{\"name\":\"Kinesis\",\"effect\":\"The user distracts the target by bending a spoon. This lowers the target\u2019s accuracy.\"},\"softBoiled\":{\"name\":\"Soft-Boiled\",\"effect\":\"The user produces itself a large egg, restoring \u00bd of its max HP.\"},\"highJumpKick\":{\"name\":\"High Jump Kick\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with a knee kick from a jump. If this move misses or fails, the user takes damage equal to \u00bd of its max HP.\"},\"glare\":{\"name\":\"Glare\",\"effect\":\"The user intimidates the target with a frightful glare that will leave it paralyzed.\"},\"dreamEater\":{\"name\":\"Dream Eater\",\"effect\":\"The user eats the dreams of a sleeping target. The user\u2019s HP is restored by \u00bd of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"poisonGas\":{\"name\":\"Poison Gas\",\"effect\":\"A cloud of poison gas is sprayed in the faces of opposing Pok\u00e9mon, poisoning those it hits.\"},\"barrage\":{\"name\":\"Barrage\",\"effect\":\"Round objects are hurled at the target. This move hits 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"leechLife\":{\"name\":\"Leech Life\",\"effect\":\"The user drains the target\u2019s blood. The user\u2019s HP is restored by \u00bd of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"lovelyKiss\":{\"name\":\"Lovely Kiss\",\"effect\":\"With a scary face, the user tries to kiss the target. If it succeeds, the target falls asleep.\"},\"skyAttack\":{\"name\":\"Sky Attack\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with a powered-up dive the turn after using this move. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage, and it has a 30% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"transform\":{\"name\":\"Transform\",\"effect\":\"The user transforms into a copy of the target, right down to having the same move set. It also copies all of the target\u2019s stats apart from its HP. Copied moves have 5 PP each.\"},\"bubble\":{\"name\":\"Bubble\",\"effect\":\"A spray of countless bubbles is jetted at the opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This move has a 10% chance of lowering their Speed stats.\"},\"dizzyPunch\":{\"name\":\"Dizzy Punch\",\"effect\":\"The target is hit with rhythmically launched punches. This move has a 20% chance of confusing the target.\"},\"spore\":{\"name\":\"Spore\",\"effect\":\"The user scatters bursts of spores that induce sleep. Grass-type Pok\u00e9mon are unaffected.\"},\"flash\":{\"name\":\"Flash\",\"effect\":\"The user flashes a bright light that lowers the target\u2019s accuracy.\"},\"psywave\":{\"name\":\"Psywave\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with an odd psychic wave. This attack varies in damage, ranging from 50% to 150% of the user\u2019s level.\"},\"splash\":{\"name\":\"Splash\",\"effect\":\"The user just flops and splashes around to no effect at all\u2026\"},\"acidArmor\":{\"name\":\"Acid Armor\",\"effect\":\"The user alters its cellular structure to liquefy itself, sharply boosting its Defense stat.\"},\"crabhammer\":{\"name\":\"Crabhammer\",\"effect\":\"The target is hammered with a large pincer. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"explosion\":{\"name\":\"Explosion\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks everything around it by causing a tremendous explosion. The user faints upon using this move.\"},\"furySwipes\":{\"name\":\"Fury Swipes\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by raking the target with claws, scythes, or the like. This move hits 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"bonemerang\":{\"name\":\"Bonemerang\",\"effect\":\"The user throws the bone it holds. The bone loops around to damage the target twice\u2014coming and going.\"},\"rest\":{\"name\":\"Rest\",\"effect\":\"The user goes to sleep for 2 turns. This fully restores the user\u2019s HP and cures any status conditions. This move fails if the user\u2019s HP is full.\"},\"rockSlide\":{\"name\":\"Rock Slide\",\"effect\":\"Large boulders are hurled at opposing Pok\u00e9mon to inflict damage. This move has a 30% chance of making the targets flinch.\"},\"hyperFang\":{\"name\":\"Hyper Fang\",\"effect\":\"The user bites hard on the target with its sharp front fangs. This move has a 10% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"sharpen\":{\"name\":\"Sharpen\",\"effect\":\"The user makes its edges more jagged, which boosts its Attack stat.\"},\"conversion\":{\"name\":\"Conversion\",\"effect\":\"The user changes its type to become the same type as the move at the top of the list of moves it knows.\"},\"triAttack\":{\"name\":\"Tri Attack\",\"effect\":\"The user strikes with a simultaneous three-beam attack. This move has a 20% chance of leaving the target burned, frozen, or paralyzed.\"},\"superFang\":{\"name\":\"Super Fang\",\"effect\":\"The user chomps hard on the target with its sharp front fangs. This deals damage to the target equal to \u00bd of their remaining HP.\"},\"slash\":{\"name\":\"Slash\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with a slash of claws, scythes, or the like. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"substitute\":{\"name\":\"Substitute\",\"effect\":\"The user creates a substitute for itself by losing \u00bc of its max HP. The substitute will be hit by moves instead of the user, and it will vanish when it takes damage equal to \u00bc of the user\u2019s max HP. Sound-based moves will hit the user through the substitute.\"},\"struggle\":{\"name\":\"Struggle\",\"effect\":\"This attack is used in desperation only if the user has no remaining PP. The user loses \u00bc of its max HP.\"},\"sketch\":{\"name\":\"Sketch\",\"effect\":\"This move enables the user to permanently learn the move last used by the target. Once used, Sketch disappears.\"},\"tripleKick\":{\"name\":\"Triple Kick\",\"effect\":\"A consecutive three-kick attack that increases in power by 10 with each successive hit. When one kick misses, the move ends.\"},\"thief\":{\"name\":\"Thief\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks and tries to steal from the target simultaneously. This move has a 30% chance to steal one of the target\u2019s held items.\"},\"spiderWeb\":{\"name\":\"Spider Web\",\"effect\":\"The user ensnares the target with thin, gooey silk so it can\u2019t flee or be switched out from battle.\"},\"mindReader\":{\"name\":\"Mind Reader\",\"effect\":\"The user senses the target\u2019s movements with its mind to ensure its next attack does not miss the target.\"},\"nightmare\":{\"name\":\"Nightmare\",\"effect\":\"A sleeping target sees a nightmare that inflicts damage equal to \u00bc of its max HP at the end of every turn. This fails if the target is not asleep.\"},\"flameWheel\":{\"name\":\"Flame Wheel\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by cloaking itself in fire and charging at the target. This move has a 10% chance of burning the target and thaws out the user if it is frozen.\"},\"snore\":{\"name\":\"Snore\",\"effect\":\"If the user is asleep, it attacks with a harsh noise. This move has a 30% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"curse\":{\"name\":\"Curse\",\"effect\":\"The user boosts its Attack and Defense stats in exchange for lowering its Speed stat. If the user is a Ghost type, it instead loses \u00bd of its max HP to inflict a curse on the target. A Pok\u00e9mon inflicted by the curse loses \u00bc of its max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"flail\":{\"name\":\"Flail\",\"effect\":\"The user flails about aimlessly to attack. The less HP the user has, the greater the move\u2019s power (ranging between 20 and 200).\"},\"conversion2\":{\"name\":\"Conversion 2\",\"effect\":\"The user changes its type to make itself resistant to the type of the move the target used last.\"},\"aeroblast\":{\"name\":\"Aeroblast\",\"effect\":\"A vortex of air is shot at the target to inflict damage. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"cottonSpore\":{\"name\":\"Cotton Spore\",\"effect\":\"The user releases cotton-like spores that cling to opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This harshly lowers their Speed stats. Grass-type Pok\u00e9mon are unaffected.\"},\"reversal\":{\"name\":\"Reversal\",\"effect\":\"An all-out attack that becomes more powerful the less HP the user has (ranging between 20 and 200).\"},\"spite\":{\"name\":\"Spite\",\"effect\":\"The user unleashes its grudge on the move last used by the target by cutting 4 PP from it.\"},\"powderSnow\":{\"name\":\"Powder Snow\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks opposing Pok\u00e9mon with a chilling gust of powdery snow. This move has a 10% chance of freezing targets.\"},\"protect\":{\"name\":\"Protect\",\"effect\":\"This move enables the user to protect itself from all attacks. With each consecutive use, this move\u2019s chance of success becomes \u2153 of what it was before.\"},\"machPunch\":{\"name\":\"Mach Punch\",\"effect\":\"The user throws a punch at blinding speed. This move always goes first.\"},\"scaryFace\":{\"name\":\"Scary Face\",\"effect\":\"The user frightens the target with a scary face to harshly lower its Speed stat.\"},\"feintAttack\":{\"name\":\"Feint Attack\",\"effect\":\"The user approaches the target disarmingly, then throws a sucker punch. This attack never misses.\"},\"sweetKiss\":{\"name\":\"Sweet Kiss\",\"effect\":\"The user kisses the target with a sweet, angelic cuteness that causes confusion.\"},\"bellyDrum\":{\"name\":\"Belly Drum\",\"effect\":\"The user loses \u00bd of its max HP to maximize its Attack stat. This move fails if the user doesn\u2019t have enough remaining HP.\"},\"sludgeBomb\":{\"name\":\"Sludge Bomb\",\"effect\":\"The user hurls unsanitary sludge at the target to inflict damage. This move has a 30% chance of poisoning the target.\"},\"mudSlap\":{\"name\":\"Mud-Slap\",\"effect\":\"The user hurls mud in the target\u2019s face to inflict damage and lower its accuracy.\"},\"octazooka\":{\"name\":\"Octazooka\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by spraying ink in the target\u2019s face. This move has a 50% chance of lowering the target\u2019s accuracy.\"},\"spikes\":{\"name\":\"Spikes\",\"effect\":\"The user lays a trap of spikes at the feet of the opposing team. Opposing Pok\u00e9mon that land on these spikes when switching into battle will receive damage equal to \u215b of their max HP. Up to 3 layers can be set, with each layer increasing the damage taken.\"},\"zapCannon\":{\"name\":\"Zap Cannon\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by firing an electric blast like a cannon. This also leaves the target with paralysis.\"},\"foresight\":{\"name\":\"Foresight\",\"effect\":\"Enables a Ghost-type target to be hit by Normal- and Fighting-type attacks. This also negates the target\u2019s evasiveness stat if it is boosted.\"},\"destinyBond\":{\"name\":\"Destiny Bond\",\"effect\":\"If the user is knocked out after using this move, the Pok\u00e9mon that knocked it out will also faint. This move fails if used in succession. Boss Pok\u00e9mon are immune to this move.\"},\"perishSong\":{\"name\":\"Perish Song\",\"effect\":\"Any Pok\u00e9mon that hears this song faints in 3 turns, unless it switches out of battle. Boss Pok\u00e9mon are immune to this move.\"},\"icyWind\":{\"name\":\"Icy Wind\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with a gust of chilled air. This also lowers opposing Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Speed stats.\"},\"detect\":{\"name\":\"Detect\",\"effect\":\"This move enables the user to protect itself from all attacks. With each consecutive use, this move\u2019s chance of success becomes \u2153 of what it was before.\"},\"boneRush\":{\"name\":\"Bone Rush\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by striking the target with a hard bone. This move hits 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"lockOn\":{\"name\":\"Lock-On\",\"effect\":\"The user takes sure aim at the target. This ensures the user\u2019s next move does not miss that target.\"},\"outrage\":{\"name\":\"Outrage\",\"effect\":\"The user rampages and attacks for 2-3 turns. The user then becomes confused.\"},\"sandstorm\":{\"name\":\"Sandstorm\",\"effect\":\"The user summons a sandstorm for 5 turns. Pok\u00e9mon that are not Rock, Ground, or Steel types take damage equal to \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of their max HP at the end of every turn. This also boosts the Sp. Def stats of Rock types by 50%.\"},\"gigaDrain\":{\"name\":\"Giga Drain\",\"effect\":\"A nutrient-draining attack. The user\u2019s HP is restored by \u00bd of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"endure\":{\"name\":\"Endure\",\"effect\":\"The user endures any attack with at least 1 HP. With each consecutive use, this move\u2019s chance of success becomes \u2153 of what it was before.\"},\"charm\":{\"name\":\"Charm\",\"effect\":\"The user gazes at the target rather charmingly, making it less wary. This harshly lowers the target\u2019s Attack stat.\"},\"rollout\":{\"name\":\"Rollout\",\"effect\":\"The user continually rolls into the target over 5 turns. This attack doubles in power each time it hits, and resets after 5 turns have passed or if the move is interrupted.\"},\"falseSwipe\":{\"name\":\"False Swipe\",\"effect\":\"A restrained attack that prevents the target from fainting. The target is left with at least 1 HP.\"},\"swagger\":{\"name\":\"Swagger\",\"effect\":\"The user enrages and confuses the target. However, this also sharply boosts the target\u2019s Attack stat.\"},\"milkDrink\":{\"name\":\"Milk Drink\",\"effect\":\"The user produces highly nutritious milk, restoring \u00bd of the user or an ally\u2019s max HP.\"},\"spark\":{\"name\":\"Spark\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with an electrically charged tackle. This move has a 30% chance of paralyzing the target.\"},\"furyCutter\":{\"name\":\"Fury Cutter\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by slashing the target with scythes, claws, or the like. This move\u2019s power is doubled if it hits in succession, up to a max of 160 power, and resets if this move is interrupted or another move is used.\"},\"steelWing\":{\"name\":\"Steel Wing\",\"effect\":\"The target is hit with wings of steel. This move has a 10% chance of boosting the user\u2019s Defense stat.\"},\"meanLook\":{\"name\":\"Mean Look\",\"effect\":\"The user pins the target with a dark, arresting look. The target becomes unable to flee or be switched out of battle.\"},\"attract\":{\"name\":\"Attract\",\"effect\":\"If the target is of the opposite gender to the user, it becomes infatuated with the user and will have a 50% chance of being unable to use its moves.\"},\"sleepTalk\":{\"name\":\"Sleep Talk\",\"effect\":\"The user randomly uses one of the moves it knows. This move can only be used while the user is asleep.\"},\"healBell\":{\"name\":\"Heal Bell\",\"effect\":\"The user makes a soothing bell chime to cure the status conditions of all its fellow party Pok\u00e9mon and allies.\"},\"return\":{\"name\":\"Return\",\"effect\":\"This full-power attack grows more powerful the more the user likes its Trainer (ranging between 1 and 102).\"},\"present\":{\"name\":\"Present\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by giving the target a gift with a hidden trap, randomly dealing damage with 40, 80, or 120 power. The gift restores \u00bc of the target\u2019s max HP sometimes, however.\"},\"frustration\":{\"name\":\"Frustration\",\"effect\":\"This full-power attack grows more powerful the less the user likes its Trainer (ranging between 1 and 102).\"},\"safeguard\":{\"name\":\"Safeguard\",\"effect\":\"The user creates a protective field that prevents status conditions for 5 turns.\"},\"painSplit\":{\"name\":\"Pain Split\",\"effect\":\"The user adds its remaining HP to the target\u2019s remaining HP, then splits the total in half for them to share. Boss Pok\u00e9mon are immune to this move.\"},\"sacredFire\":{\"name\":\"Sacred Fire\",\"effect\":\"The target is razed with a mystical fire of great intensity. This move has a 50% chance of burning the target and thaws out the user if it is frozen.\"},\"magnitude\":{\"name\":\"Magnitude\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks everything around it with a ground-shaking quake. Its power varies based on the magnitude of the quake, with the possibility of being 10, 30, 50, 70, 90, 110, or 150 power. This move\u2019s power is doubled against targets underground from Dig, and halved while Grassy Terrain is active.\"},\"dynamicPunch\":{\"name\":\"Dynamic Punch\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by punching the target with full concentrated power. This also confuses the target.\"},\"megahorn\":{\"name\":\"Megahorn\",\"effect\":\"Using its tough and impressive horn, the user rams into the target with no letup.\"},\"dragonBreath\":{\"name\":\"Dragon Breath\",\"effect\":\"The user exhales a mighty gust that inflicts damage. This move has a 30% chance of paralyzing the target.\"},\"batonPass\":{\"name\":\"Baton Pass\",\"effect\":\"The user switches out of battle to be replaced by another party Pok\u00e9mon. If the user had any stat changes, a substitute, or other such effects, they will be passed on to the Pok\u00e9mon switching in.\"},\"encore\":{\"name\":\"Encore\",\"effect\":\"The user compels the target to keep using the move it encored for 3 turns.\"},\"pursuit\":{\"name\":\"Pursuit\",\"effect\":\"The power of this attack move is doubled if it\u2019s used on a target that\u2019s switching out of battle.\"},\"rapidSpin\":{\"name\":\"Rapid Spin\",\"effect\":\"The user performs a spin attack that can eliminate the effects of binding moves and Leech Seed, as well as any entry hazards on its side. This also boosts the user\u2019s Speed stat.\"},\"sweetScent\":{\"name\":\"Sweet Scent\",\"effect\":\"The user releases a scent that harshly lowers opposing Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s evasiveness.\"},\"ironTail\":{\"name\":\"Iron Tail\",\"effect\":\"The target is slammed with a steel-hard tail. This move has a 30% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Defense stat.\"},\"metalClaw\":{\"name\":\"Metal Claw\",\"effect\":\"The target is raked with steel claws. This move has a 10% chance of boosting the user\u2019s Attack stat.\"},\"vitalThrow\":{\"name\":\"Vital Throw\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks last. In return, this throw move never misses.\"},\"morningSun\":{\"name\":\"Morning Sun\",\"effect\":\"The user bathes in the pleasant rays of the sun, restoring \u00bd of its max HP. In harsh sunlight, \u2154 of its max HP will be restored instead. In all other weather conditions, \u00bc of its max HP will be restored instead.\"},\"synthesis\":{\"name\":\"Synthesis\",\"effect\":\"The user produces energy through photosynthesis, restoring \u00bd of its max HP. In harsh sunlight, \u2154 of its max HP will be restored instead. In all other weather conditions, \u00bc of its max HP will be restored instead.\"},\"moonlight\":{\"name\":\"Moonlight\",\"effect\":\"The user bathes in the soothing light of the moon, restoring \u00bd of its max HP. In harsh sunlight, \u2154 of its max HP will be restored instead. In all other weather conditions, \u00bc of its max HP will be restored instead.\"},\"hiddenPower\":{\"name\":\"Hidden Power\",\"effect\":\"A unique attack that varies in type depending on the Pok\u00e9mon using it.\"},\"crossChop\":{\"name\":\"Cross Chop\",\"effect\":\"The user delivers a double chop with its forearms crossed. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"twister\":{\"name\":\"Twister\",\"effect\":\"The user whips up a vicious tornado to tear at opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This move has a 20% chance of making targets flinch, and can also hit a target that\u2019s in the air from Fly, Bounce, or Sky Drop with its power doubled.\"},\"rainDance\":{\"name\":\"Rain Dance\",\"effect\":\"The user summons a heavy rain that falls for 5 turns, powering up Water-type moves by 50%. The rain also halves the damage dealt by Fire-type moves.\"},\"sunnyDay\":{\"name\":\"Sunny Day\",\"effect\":\"The user intensifies the sun for 5 turns, powering up Fire-type moves by 50%. The sunlight also halves the damage dealt by Water-type moves.\"},\"crunch\":{\"name\":\"Crunch\",\"effect\":\"The user crunches up the target with sharp fangs. This move has a 20% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Defense stat.\"},\"mirrorCoat\":{\"name\":\"Mirror Coat\",\"effect\":\"A retaliatory attack that counters any special move, inflicting double the damage taken.\"},\"psychUp\":{\"name\":\"Psych Up\",\"effect\":\"The user hypnotizes itself into copying any stat change made by the target.\"},\"extremeSpeed\":{\"name\":\"Extreme Speed\",\"effect\":\"The user charges the target at blinding speed. This move always goes first.\"},\"ancientPower\":{\"name\":\"Ancient Power\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with a prehistoric power. This has a 10% chance of boosting the user\u2019s Attack, Defense, Sp. Atk, Sp. Def, and Speed stats all at once.\"},\"shadowBall\":{\"name\":\"Shadow Ball\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by hurling a shadowy blob at the target. This move has a 20% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"futureSight\":{\"name\":\"Future Sight\",\"effect\":\"2 turns after this move is used, a hunk of psychic energy attacks the target.\"},\"rockSmash\":{\"name\":\"Rock Smash\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with a punch. This move has a 50% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Defense stat.\"},\"whirlpool\":{\"name\":\"Whirlpool\",\"effect\":\"The user traps the target inside a violent, swirling whirlpool. For 4-5 turns, the target takes damage equal to \u215b of its max HP at the end of every turn. This move\u2019s power is doubled against targets submerged with Dive.\"},\"beatUp\":{\"name\":\"Beat Up\",\"effect\":\"The user gets all party Pok\u00e9mon to attack the target, attacking as many times as the number of healthy Pok\u00e9mon in the user\u2019s party. This move\u2019s power is calculated based on the Attack stats of the party Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"fakeOut\":{\"name\":\"Fake Out\",\"effect\":\"This attack hits first and makes the target flinch. This move fails unless it is the first move used by the user after it enters a battle.\"},\"uproar\":{\"name\":\"Uproar\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks in an uproar for 3 turns. During that time, no Pok\u00e9mon can fall asleep.\"},\"stockpile\":{\"name\":\"Stockpile\",\"effect\":\"The user raises its Stockpiling level by 1 and boosts its Defense and Sp. Def stats. This move can be used up to 3 times.\"},\"spitUp\":{\"name\":\"Spit Up\",\"effect\":\"The levels stored using the move Stockpile are released at once in an attack. The more power is stored, the greater the move\u2019s power (ranging between 100 and 300).\"},\"swallow\":{\"name\":\"Swallow\",\"effect\":\"The levels stored using the move Stockpile are absorbed by the user to restore its HP. Level 1: \u00bc of the user\u2019s max HP is restored. Level 2: \u00bd of the user\u2019s max HP is restored. Level 3: The user\u2019s HP is fully restored.\"},\"heatWave\":{\"name\":\"Heat Wave\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by blasting opposing Pok\u00e9mon with searingly hot wind. This move has a 10% chance of burning targets.\"},\"hail\":{\"name\":\"Hail\",\"effect\":\"The user summons a hailstorm lasting 5 turns. All Pok\u00e9mon except Ice types will be damaged for \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of their max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"torment\":{\"name\":\"Torment\",\"effect\":\"The user torments and enrages the target, making it incapable of using the same move twice in a row.\"},\"flatter\":{\"name\":\"Flatter\",\"effect\":\"Flattery is used to confuse the target. However, this also boosts the target\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"willOWisp\":{\"name\":\"Will-O-Wisp\",\"effect\":\"The user shoots a sinister flame at the target to inflict a burn.\"},\"memento\":{\"name\":\"Memento\",\"effect\":\"The user faints. In return, the target\u2019s Attack and Sp. Atk stats are harshly lowered.\"},\"facade\":{\"name\":\"Facade\",\"effect\":\"This move\u2019s power is doubled if the user is poisoned, badly poisoned, burned, or paralyzed. Although this move is a physical move, the damage it deals is not halved when the user is burned.\"},\"focusPunch\":{\"name\":\"Focus Punch\",\"effect\":\"The user moves last to focus its mind before launching a punch. This move fails if the user is hit before using the move.\"},\"smellingSalts\":{\"name\":\"Smelling Salts\",\"effect\":\"This attack\u2019s power is doubled when used on a target with paralysis. This also cures the target\u2019s paralysis, however.\"},\"followMe\":{\"name\":\"Follow Me\",\"effect\":\"The user draws attention to itself, making all opposing Pok\u00e9mon take aim only at the user.\"},\"naturePower\":{\"name\":\"Nature Power\",\"effect\":\"This attack makes use of nature\u2019s power. Its effects vary depending on the biome or terrain this move was used in.\"},\"charge\":{\"name\":\"Charge\",\"effect\":\"The user becomes charged, doubling the power of the next Electric-type move it uses. This also boosts the user\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"taunt\":{\"name\":\"Taunt\",\"effect\":\"The target is taunted into a rage that allows it to use only attack moves for 3 turns.\"},\"helpingHand\":{\"name\":\"Helping Hand\",\"effect\":\"The user assists an ally by boosting the power of that ally\u2019s attack by 50%.\"},\"trick\":{\"name\":\"Trick\",\"effect\":\"The user catches the target off guard and swaps a target\u2019s held item with its own.\"},\"rolePlay\":{\"name\":\"Role Play\",\"effect\":\"The user mimics the target completely, copying the target\u2019s Ability.\"},\"wish\":{\"name\":\"Wish\",\"effect\":\"One turn after this move is used, the user\u2019s or its replacement\u2019s HP is restored by up to \u00bd the user\u2019s max HP\"},\"assist\":{\"name\":\"Assist\",\"effect\":\"The user hurriedly and randomly uses a move among those known by ally Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"ingrain\":{\"name\":\"Ingrain\",\"effect\":\"The user lays roots that restore \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of its max HP at the end of every turn. Because it\u2019s rooted, the user becomes grounded and cannot flee or be switched out of battle.\"},\"superpower\":{\"name\":\"Superpower\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with great power. This also lowers the user\u2019s Attack and Defense stats.\"},\"magicCoat\":{\"name\":\"Magic Coat\",\"effect\":\"Until the end of the turn, certain non-damaging moves directed at the user are blocked by a barrier and reflected back to the user of those moves.\"},\"recycle\":{\"name\":\"Recycle\",\"effect\":\"The user recycles a held item that has been used in battle so it can be used again.\"},\"revenge\":{\"name\":\"Revenge\",\"effect\":\"The user moves last. The power of this move is doubled if the target has inflicted damage on the user in the same turn.\"},\"brickBreak\":{\"name\":\"Brick Break\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with a swift chop. This move can also break barriers such as Light Screen, Reflect, and Aurora Veil.\"},\"yawn\":{\"name\":\"Yawn\",\"effect\":\"The user lets loose a huge yawn that lulls the target into falling asleep on the next turn.\"},\"knockOff\":{\"name\":\"Knock Off\",\"effect\":\"The user slaps down a target\u2019s held item, removing the item. This move\u2019s power is boosted by 50% if the target has a held item.\"},\"endeavor\":{\"name\":\"Endeavor\",\"effect\":\"The user inflicts damage by cutting down the target\u2019s HP to roughly equal the user\u2019s HP. This fails if the target\u2019s HP is the same as or lower than the user\u2019s. Boss Pok\u00e9mon are immune to this move.\"},\"eruption\":{\"name\":\"Eruption\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks opposing Pok\u00e9mon with explosive fury. The less HP the user has left, the lower this move\u2019s power (ranging between 1 and 150).\"},\"skillSwap\":{\"name\":\"Skill Swap\",\"effect\":\"The user employs its psychic power to exchange Abilities with the target.\"},\"imprison\":{\"name\":\"Imprison\",\"effect\":\"If opposing Pok\u00e9mon know any move also known by the user, they are prevented from using it.\"},\"refresh\":{\"name\":\"Refresh\",\"effect\":\"The user rests to cure itself of poisoning, a burn, or paralysis.\"},\"grudge\":{\"name\":\"Grudge\",\"effect\":\"If the user faints, the user\u2019s grudge fully depletes the PP of the opponent\u2019s move that knocked it out.\"},\"snatch\":{\"name\":\"Snatch\",\"effect\":\"The user steals the effects of any attempts to use a healing or stat-changing move.\"},\"secretPower\":{\"name\":\"Secret Power\",\"effect\":\"The additional effects of this attack depend upon the biome or terrain it was used in.\"},\"dive\":{\"name\":\"Dive\",\"effect\":\"The user dives on the first turn, then floats up and attacks on the next turn.\"},\"armThrust\":{\"name\":\"Arm Thrust\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with open-palmed arm thrusts. This move hits 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"camouflage\":{\"name\":\"Camouflage\",\"effect\":\"The user\u2019s type is changed depending on the biome or terrain this move was used in.\"},\"tailGlow\":{\"name\":\"Tail Glow\",\"effect\":\"The user flashes bright lights as it focuses its mind, drastically boosting its Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"lusterPurge\":{\"name\":\"Luster Purge\",\"effect\":\"The user lets loose a damaging burst of light. This move has a 50% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"mistBall\":{\"name\":\"Mist Ball\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with a ball packed with mist-like down. This move has a 50% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"featherDance\":{\"name\":\"Feather Dance\",\"effect\":\"The user covers the target\u2019s body with a mass of down that harshly lowers its Attack stat.\"},\"teeterDance\":{\"name\":\"Teeter Dance\",\"effect\":\"The user performs a wobbly dance that confuses every Pok\u00e9mon around it.\"},\"blazeKick\":{\"name\":\"Blaze Kick\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with a fiery kick that has a 10% chance of burning the target. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"mudSport\":{\"name\":\"Mud Sport\",\"effect\":\"The user kicks up mud on the battlefield. This weakens the Electric-type moves of all Pok\u00e9mon on the field by 50% for 5 turns.\"},\"iceBall\":{\"name\":\"Ice Ball\",\"effect\":\"The user continually rolls into the target over 5 turns. This attack doubles in power each time it hits, and resets after 5 turns have passed or if the move is interrupted.\"},\"needleArm\":{\"name\":\"Needle Arm\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by wildly swinging its thorny arms. This move has a 30% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"slackOff\":{\"name\":\"Slack Off\",\"effect\":\"The user slacks off, restoring \u00bd of its max HP.\"},\"hyperVoice\":{\"name\":\"Hyper Voice\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by letting loose a horribly loud, resounding cry.\"},\"poisonFang\":{\"name\":\"Poison Fang\",\"effect\":\"The user bites the target with toxic fangs. This move has a 50% chance of badly poisoning the target.\"},\"crushClaw\":{\"name\":\"Crush Claw\",\"effect\":\"The user slashes the target with hard and sharp claws. This move has a 50% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Defense stat.\"},\"blastBurn\":{\"name\":\"Blast Burn\",\"effect\":\"The target is razed by a fiery explosion. The user can\u2019t move on the next turn.\"},\"hydroCannon\":{\"name\":\"Hydro Cannon\",\"effect\":\"The target is hit with a watery blast. The user can\u2019t move on the next turn.\"},\"meteorMash\":{\"name\":\"Meteor Mash\",\"effect\":\"The target is hit with a hard punch fired like a meteor. This move has a 20% chance of boosting the user\u2019s Attack stat.\"},\"astonish\":{\"name\":\"Astonish\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target by crying out in a startling fashion. This move has a 30% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"weatherBall\":{\"name\":\"Weather Ball\",\"effect\":\"This move\u2019s type and power change depending on the weather at the time the move is used.\"},\"aromatherapy\":{\"name\":\"Aromatherapy\",\"effect\":\"The user releases a soothing scent to cure the status conditions of all its fellow party Pok\u00e9mon and allies.\"},\"fakeTears\":{\"name\":\"Fake Tears\",\"effect\":\"The user feigns crying to fluster the target. This harshly lowers the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"airCutter\":{\"name\":\"Air Cutter\",\"effect\":\"The user launches razor-like wind to slash opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"overheat\":{\"name\":\"Overheat\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with all its might. The recoil from this move harshly lowers the user\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"odorSleuth\":{\"name\":\"Odor Sleuth\",\"effect\":\"Enables a Ghost-type target to be hit by Normal- and Fighting-type attacks. This also negates the target\u2019s evasiveness stat if it is boosted.\"},\"rockTomb\":{\"name\":\"Rock Tomb\",\"effect\":\"The user hurls boulders at the target to inflict damage. This also lowers the target\u2019s Speed stat by cutting off its movement.\"},\"silverWind\":{\"name\":\"Silver Wind\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with powdery scales blown by the wind. This has a 10% chance of boosting the user\u2019s Attack, Defense, Sp. Atk, Sp. Def, and Speed stats all at once.\"},\"metalSound\":{\"name\":\"Metal Sound\",\"effect\":\"A horrible sound like scraping metal harshly lowers the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"grassWhistle\":{\"name\":\"Grass Whistle\",\"effect\":\"The user plays a pleasant melody that puts the target to sleep.\"},\"tickle\":{\"name\":\"Tickle\",\"effect\":\"The user tickles the target into laughing, lowering its Attack and Defense stats.\"},\"cosmicPower\":{\"name\":\"Cosmic Power\",\"effect\":\"The user absorbs a mystical power from space to boost its Defense and Sp. Def stats.\"},\"waterSpout\":{\"name\":\"Water Spout\",\"effect\":\"The user spouts water to damage opposing Pok\u00e9mon. The less HP the user has left, the lower this move\u2019s power (ranging between 1 and 150).\"},\"signalBeam\":{\"name\":\"Signal Beam\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with a sinister beam of light. This move has a 10% chance of confusing the target.\"},\"shadowPunch\":{\"name\":\"Shadow Punch\",\"effect\":\"The user throws a punch from the shadows. This attack never misses.\"},\"extrasensory\":{\"name\":\"Extrasensory\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with an odd, unseeable power. This move has a 10% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"skyUppercut\":{\"name\":\"Sky Uppercut\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with an uppercut thrown skyward with force. This move can also hit a target that\u2019s in the air from Fly, Bounce, or Sky Drop.\"},\"sandTomb\":{\"name\":\"Sand Tomb\",\"effect\":\"The user traps the target inside a harshly raging sandstorm. For 4-5 turns, the target takes damage equal to \u215b of its max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"sheerCold\":{\"name\":\"Sheer Cold\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with a blast of absolute-zero cold. The target faints instantly if this attack hits, unless it is a Boss Pok\u00e9mon. This move does not affect Ice types. The accuracy of this move is fixed at 30%. If used by Pok\u00e9mon other than Ice types, the accuracy of this move is 20%.\"},\"muddyWater\":{\"name\":\"Muddy Water\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by shooting muddy water at opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This move has a 30% chance of lowering their accuracy.\"},\"bulletSeed\":{\"name\":\"Bullet Seed\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by forcefully shooting seeds at the target. This move hits 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"aerialAce\":{\"name\":\"Aerial Ace\",\"effect\":\"The user confounds the target with speed, then slashes. This attack never misses.\"},\"icicleSpear\":{\"name\":\"Icicle Spear\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by launching sharp icicles at the target. This move hits 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"ironDefense\":{\"name\":\"Iron Defense\",\"effect\":\"The user hardens its body\u2019s surface like iron, sharply boosting its Defense stat.\"},\"block\":{\"name\":\"Block\",\"effect\":\"The user blocks the target\u2019s way with arms spread wide to prevent the target from fleeing or switching out of battle.\"},\"howl\":{\"name\":\"Howl\",\"effect\":\"The user howls loudly to rouse itself and its allies. This boosts their Attack stats.\"},\"dragonClaw\":{\"name\":\"Dragon Claw\",\"effect\":\"The user slashes the target with huge, sharp claws to inflict damage.\"},\"frenzyPlant\":{\"name\":\"Frenzy Plant\",\"effect\":\"The user slams the target with the roots of an enormous tree. The user can\u2019t move on the next turn.\"},\"bulkUp\":{\"name\":\"Bulk Up\",\"effect\":\"The user tenses its muscles to bulk up its body, boosting its Attack and Defense stats.\"},\"bounce\":{\"name\":\"Bounce\",\"effect\":\"The user bounces up high on the first turn, then drops onto the target on the next turn. This move has a 30% chance of paralyzing the target.\"},\"mudShot\":{\"name\":\"Mud Shot\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by hurling a blob of mud at the target. This also lowers the target\u2019s Speed stat.\"},\"poisonTail\":{\"name\":\"Poison Tail\",\"effect\":\"The user hits the target with its tail. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage and has a 10% chance of poisoning the target.\"},\"covet\":{\"name\":\"Covet\",\"effect\":\"The user endearingly approaches the target, then tries to steal from the target. This move has a 30% chance to steal one of the target\u2019s held items.\"},\"voltTackle\":{\"name\":\"Volt Tackle\",\"effect\":\"The user electrifies itself and charges the target to inflict damage. The user takes \u2153 of the damage dealt by this move. This also has a 10% chance of paralyzing the target.\"},\"magicalLeaf\":{\"name\":\"Magical Leaf\",\"effect\":\"The user scatters curious leaves that chase the target. This attack never misses.\"},\"waterSport\":{\"name\":\"Water Sport\",\"effect\":\"The user soaks the battlefield with water. This weakens the Fire-type moves of all Pok\u00e9mon on the field by 50% for 5 turns.\"},\"calmMind\":{\"name\":\"Calm Mind\",\"effect\":\"The user quietly focuses its mind and calms its spirit to boost its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def stats.\"},\"leafBlade\":{\"name\":\"Leaf Blade\",\"effect\":\"The user handles a sharp leaf like a sword and cuts the target to inflict damage. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"dragonDance\":{\"name\":\"Dragon Dance\",\"effect\":\"The user vigorously performs a mystic, powerful dance that boosts its Attack and Speed stats.\"},\"rockBlast\":{\"name\":\"Rock Blast\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by hurling hard rocks at the target. This move hits 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"shockWave\":{\"name\":\"Shock Wave\",\"effect\":\"The user strikes the target with a quick jolt of electricity. This attack never misses.\"},\"waterPulse\":{\"name\":\"Water Pulse\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with a pulsing blast of water. This move has a 20% chance of confusing the target.\"},\"doomDesire\":{\"name\":\"Doom Desire\",\"effect\":\"2 turns after this move is used, a concentrated bundle of light blasts the target.\"},\"psychoBoost\":{\"name\":\"Psycho Boost\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with all its might. The recoil from this move harshly lowers the user\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"roost\":{\"name\":\"Roost\",\"effect\":\"The user lands and rests its body, restoring \u00bd of its max HP. If the user is a Flying type, it will lose the Flying type for the turn.\"},\"gravity\":{\"name\":\"Gravity\",\"effect\":\"Boosts the accuracy of moves by 67% and grounds Pok\u00e9mon such as Flying types or ones with the Levitate Ability for 5 turns. Moves that involve flying cannot be used.\"},\"miracleEye\":{\"name\":\"Miracle Eye\",\"effect\":\"Enables a Dark-type target to be hit by Psychic-type attacks. This also negates the target\u2019s evasiveness stat if it is boosted.\"},\"wakeUpSlap\":{\"name\":\"Wake-Up Slap\",\"effect\":\"This move\u2019s power is doubled on a sleeping target. This also wakes the target up, however.\"},\"hammerArm\":{\"name\":\"Hammer Arm\",\"effect\":\"The user swings its strong, heavy fist at the target to inflict damage. This also lowers the user\u2019s Speed stat.\"},\"gyroBall\":{\"name\":\"Gyro Ball\",\"effect\":\"The user tackles the target with a high-speed spin. The slower the user is than the target, the greater the move\u2019s power (ranging between 1 and 150).\"},\"healingWish\":{\"name\":\"Healing Wish\",\"effect\":\"The user faints. In return, the Pok\u00e9mon taking its place will have its HP restored and status conditions cured.\"},\"brine\":{\"name\":\"Brine\",\"effect\":\"This move\u2019s power is doubled if the target\u2019s HP is at half or less.\"},\"naturalGift\":{\"name\":\"Natural Gift\",\"effect\":\"The user draws power to attack by using a held Berry. The Berry determines the move\u2019s type and power.\"},\"feint\":{\"name\":\"Feint\",\"effect\":\"This move can hit a target using a move such as Protect or Detect and removes the effects of those moves.\"},\"pluck\":{\"name\":\"Pluck\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by pecking the target. If the target is holding a Berry, the user eats it and gains its effect.\"},\"tailwind\":{\"name\":\"Tailwind\",\"effect\":\"The user whips up a turbulent whirlwind that doubles the Speed stats of itself and its allies for 4 turns.\"},\"acupressure\":{\"name\":\"Acupressure\",\"effect\":\"The user applies pressure to stress points, sharply boosting one of its or its allies\u2019 stats.\"},\"metalBurst\":{\"name\":\"Metal Burst\",\"effect\":\"The user retaliates to deal 1.5x the damage it took from an opponent\u2019s move during the turn this move is used.\"},\"uTurn\":{\"name\":\"U-turn\",\"effect\":\"After making its attack, the user rushes back to switch places with a party Pok\u00e9mon in waiting.\"},\"closeCombat\":{\"name\":\"Close Combat\",\"effect\":\"The user fights the target up close, inflicting damage without guarding itself. This also lowers the user\u2019s Defense and Sp. Def stats.\"},\"payback\":{\"name\":\"Payback\",\"effect\":\"The user stores power, then attacks. This move\u2019s power is doubled if the user moves after the target.\"},\"assurance\":{\"name\":\"Assurance\",\"effect\":\"This move\u2019s power is doubled if the target has already taken some damage in the same turn.\"},\"embargo\":{\"name\":\"Embargo\",\"effect\":\"This move prevents the target from using its held items for 5 turns.\"},\"fling\":{\"name\":\"Fling\",\"effect\":\"The user flings one of its held items at the target to attack. This move\u2019s power and effects depend on the item.\"},\"psychoShift\":{\"name\":\"Psycho Shift\",\"effect\":\"Using its psychic power of suggestion, the user transfers its status conditions to the target.\"},\"trumpCard\":{\"name\":\"Trump Card\",\"effect\":\"This move\u2019s power starts at 40 and increases as its remaining PP decreases: 50 at 4 PP, 60 at 3 PP, 80 at 2 PP, and 200 at 1 PP. This move never misses.\"},\"healBlock\":{\"name\":\"Heal Block\",\"effect\":\"For 5 turns, the user prevents the opposing team from using any moves, Abilities, or held items that recover HP.\"},\"wringOut\":{\"name\":\"Wring Out\",\"effect\":\"The user powerfully wrings the target. The more HP the target has, the greater the move\u2019s power (ranging between 1 and 120).\"},\"powerTrick\":{\"name\":\"Power Trick\",\"effect\":\"The user employs its psychic power to switch its Attack stat with its Defense stat.\"},\"gastroAcid\":{\"name\":\"Gastro Acid\",\"effect\":\"The user hurls up its stomach acids on the target. The fluid eliminates the effect of the target\u2019s Ability and Passive.\"},\"luckyChant\":{\"name\":\"Lucky Chant\",\"effect\":\"The user chants an incantation toward the sky, preventing opposing Pok\u00e9mon from landing critical hits for 5 turns.\"},\"meFirst\":{\"name\":\"Me First\",\"effect\":\"The user cuts ahead of the target to copy and use the target\u2019s intended move, boosting its power by 50%. This move fails if it isn\u2019t used first.\"},\"copycat\":{\"name\":\"Copycat\",\"effect\":\"The user mimics the move that was last used. This move fails if no other move has been used yet, or if the last move used cannot be copied.\"},\"powerSwap\":{\"name\":\"Power Swap\",\"effect\":\"The user employs its psychic power to switch changes to its Attack and Sp. Atk stats with the target.\"},\"guardSwap\":{\"name\":\"Guard Swap\",\"effect\":\"The user employs its psychic power to switch changes to its Defense and Sp. Def stats with the target.\"},\"punishment\":{\"name\":\"Punishment\",\"effect\":\"This move\u2019s power is increased by 20 for each stage that the target\u2019s stats have been boosted.\"},\"lastResort\":{\"name\":\"Last Resort\",\"effect\":\"This move can be used only after the user has used all the other moves it knows in the battle.\"},\"worrySeed\":{\"name\":\"Worry Seed\",\"effect\":\"A seed that causes worry is planted on the target. It prevents sleep by making the target\u2019s Ability Insomnia.\"},\"suckerPunch\":{\"name\":\"Sucker Punch\",\"effect\":\"This move enables the user to attack first. This move fails if the target is not readying an attack.\"},\"toxicSpikes\":{\"name\":\"Toxic Spikes\",\"effect\":\"The user lays a trap of poison spikes at the feet of the opposing team. Opposing Pok\u00e9mon that land on these spikes when switching into battle will be poisoned. A second layer of spikes will instead badly poison. Poison-types that land on these spikes will absorb and remove them from the field.\"},\"heartSwap\":{\"name\":\"Heart Swap\",\"effect\":\"The user employs its psychic power to switch stat changes with the target.\"},\"aquaRing\":{\"name\":\"Aqua Ring\",\"effect\":\"The user envelops itself in a veil made of water, restoring \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of its max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"magnetRise\":{\"name\":\"Magnet Rise\",\"effect\":\"The user levitates using electrically generated magnetism for 5 turns.\"},\"flareBlitz\":{\"name\":\"Flare Blitz\",\"effect\":\"The user cloaks itself in fire and charges the target to inflict damage. The user takes \u2153 of the damage dealt by this move. This also has a 10% chance of burning the target and thaws out the user if it is frozen.\"},\"forcePalm\":{\"name\":\"Force Palm\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with a shock wave. This move has a 30% chance of paralyzing the target.\"},\"auraSphere\":{\"name\":\"Aura Sphere\",\"effect\":\"The user lets loose a pulse of aura power from deep within its body at the target. This attack never misses.\"},\"rockPolish\":{\"name\":\"Rock Polish\",\"effect\":\"The user polishes its body to reduce drag. This sharply boosts the user\u2019s Speed stat.\"},\"poisonJab\":{\"name\":\"Poison Jab\",\"effect\":\"The target is stabbed with a tentacle, an arm, or the like steeped in poison. This move has a 30% chance of poisoning the target.\"},\"darkPulse\":{\"name\":\"Dark Pulse\",\"effect\":\"The user releases a horrible aura imbued with ill intent. This move has a 20% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"nightSlash\":{\"name\":\"Night Slash\",\"effect\":\"The user slashes the target the instant an opportunity arises. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"aquaTail\":{\"name\":\"Aqua Tail\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by swinging its tail as if it were a vicious wave in a raging storm.\"},\"seedBomb\":{\"name\":\"Seed Bomb\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by slamming a barrage of hard-shelled seeds down on the target from above.\"},\"airSlash\":{\"name\":\"Air Slash\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with a blade of air that slices even the sky. This move has a 30% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"xScissor\":{\"name\":\"X-Scissor\",\"effect\":\"The user slashes at the target by crossing its scythes, claws, or the like as if they were a pair of scissors.\"},\"bugBuzz\":{\"name\":\"Bug Buzz\",\"effect\":\"The user vibrates to generate a damaging sound wave. This move has a 10% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"dragonPulse\":{\"name\":\"Dragon Pulse\",\"effect\":\"The target is attacked with a shock wave generated by the user\u2019s gaping mouth.\"},\"dragonRush\":{\"name\":\"Dragon Rush\",\"effect\":\"The user tackles the target while exhibiting overwhelming menace. This move has a 20% chance of making the target flinch. If the target has used Minimize, this move\u2019s power is doubled and it will be sure to hit.\"},\"powerGem\":{\"name\":\"Power Gem\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with a ray of light that sparkles as if it were made of gemstones.\"},\"drainPunch\":{\"name\":\"Drain Punch\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with an energy-draining punch. The user\u2019s HP is restored by \u00bd of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"vacuumWave\":{\"name\":\"Vacuum Wave\",\"effect\":\"The user whirls its fists to send a wave of pure vacuum at the target. This move always goes first.\"},\"focusBlast\":{\"name\":\"Focus Blast\",\"effect\":\"The user heightens its mental focus and unleashes its power. This move has a 10% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"energyBall\":{\"name\":\"Energy Ball\",\"effect\":\"The user draws power from nature and fires it at the target. This move has a 10% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"braveBird\":{\"name\":\"Brave Bird\",\"effect\":\"The user tucks in its wings and charges at a low altitude. The user takes \u2153 of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"earthPower\":{\"name\":\"Earth Power\",\"effect\":\"The user makes the ground under the target erupt with power. This move has a 10% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"switcheroo\":{\"name\":\"Switcheroo\",\"effect\":\"The user trades a held item with the target faster than the eye can follow.\"},\"gigaImpact\":{\"name\":\"Giga Impact\",\"effect\":\"The user charges at the target using every bit of its power. The user can\u2019t move on the next turn.\"},\"nastyPlot\":{\"name\":\"Nasty Plot\",\"effect\":\"The user stimulates its brain by thinking bad thoughts. This sharply boosts the user\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"bulletPunch\":{\"name\":\"Bullet Punch\",\"effect\":\"The user strikes the target with tough punches as fast as bullets. This move always goes first.\"},\"avalanche\":{\"name\":\"Avalanche\",\"effect\":\"The user moves last. The power of this move is doubled if the target has inflicted damage on the user in the same turn.\"},\"iceShard\":{\"name\":\"Ice Shard\",\"effect\":\"The user flash-freezes chunks of ice and hurls them at the target. This move always goes first.\"},\"shadowClaw\":{\"name\":\"Shadow Claw\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by slashing the target with a sharp claw made from shadows. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"thunderFang\":{\"name\":\"Thunder Fang\",\"effect\":\"The user bites with electrified fangs. This move has a 10% chance of paralyzing the target and a 10% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"iceFang\":{\"name\":\"Ice Fang\",\"effect\":\"The user bites with cold-infused fangs. This move has a 10% chance of freezing the target and a 10% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"fireFang\":{\"name\":\"Fire Fang\",\"effect\":\"The user bites with flame-cloaked fangs. This move has a 10% chance of burning the target and a 10% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"shadowSneak\":{\"name\":\"Shadow Sneak\",\"effect\":\"The user extends its shadow and attacks the target from behind. This move always goes first.\"},\"mudBomb\":{\"name\":\"Mud Bomb\",\"effect\":\"The user launches a hard-packed mud ball to attack. This move has a 30% chance of lowering the target\u2019s accuracy.\"},\"psychoCut\":{\"name\":\"Psycho Cut\",\"effect\":\"The user tears at the target with blades formed by psychic power. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"zenHeadbutt\":{\"name\":\"Zen Headbutt\",\"effect\":\"The user focuses its willpower to its head and attacks the target. This move has a 20% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"mirrorShot\":{\"name\":\"Mirror Shot\",\"effect\":\"The user lets loose a flash of energy at the target from its polished body. This move has a 30% chance of lowering the target\u2019s accuracy.\"},\"flashCannon\":{\"name\":\"Flash Cannon\",\"effect\":\"The user gathers all its light energy and releases it all at once. This move has a 10% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"rockClimb\":{\"name\":\"Rock Climb\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target by smashing into it with incredible force. This move has a 20% chance of confusing the target.\"},\"defog\":{\"name\":\"Defog\",\"effect\":\"A strong wind blows away the target\u2019s barriers such as Light Screen, Reflect, Aurora Veil, or Safeguard, as well as any entry hazards or terrain from the field. This also lowers the target\u2019s evasiveness, and can clear deep fog.\"},\"trickRoom\":{\"name\":\"Trick Room\",\"effect\":\"The user moves last and creates a bizarre area in which slower Pok\u00e9mon get to move first for 5 turns.\"},\"dracoMeteor\":{\"name\":\"Draco Meteor\",\"effect\":\"Comets are summoned down from the sky onto the target. The recoil from this move harshly lowers the user\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"discharge\":{\"name\":\"Discharge\",\"effect\":\"The user strikes everything around it by letting loose a flare of electricity. This move has a 30% chance of paralyzing targets.\"},\"lavaPlume\":{\"name\":\"Lava Plume\",\"effect\":\"The user torches everything around it in an inferno of scarlet flames. This move has a 30% chance of burning targets.\"},\"leafStorm\":{\"name\":\"Leaf Storm\",\"effect\":\"The user whips up a storm of leaves around the target. The recoil from this move harshly lowers the user\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"powerWhip\":{\"name\":\"Power Whip\",\"effect\":\"The user violently whirls its vines, tentacles, or the like to lash the target.\"},\"rockWrecker\":{\"name\":\"Rock Wrecker\",\"effect\":\"The user launches a huge boulder at the target to attack. The user can\u2019t move on the next turn.\"},\"crossPoison\":{\"name\":\"Cross Poison\",\"effect\":\"A slashing attack with a poisonous blade that has a 10% chance of poisoning the target. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"gunkShot\":{\"name\":\"Gunk Shot\",\"effect\":\"The user shoots filthy garbage at the target to attack. This move has a 30% chance of poisoning the target.\"},\"ironHead\":{\"name\":\"Iron Head\",\"effect\":\"The user slams the target with its steel-hard head. This move has a 20% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"magnetBomb\":{\"name\":\"Magnet Bomb\",\"effect\":\"The user launches steel bombs that stick to the target. This attack never misses.\"},\"stoneEdge\":{\"name\":\"Stone Edge\",\"effect\":\"The user stabs the target with sharpened stones. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"captivate\":{\"name\":\"Captivate\",\"effect\":\"If any opposing Pok\u00e9mon is the opposite gender of the user, it is charmed, which harshly lowers its Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"stealthRock\":{\"name\":\"Stealth Rock\",\"effect\":\"The user lays a trap of levitating stones around the opposing team. Any Pok\u00e9mon that switch into battle will take damage equal to \u215b of their max HP. This damage differs depending on the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s type matchup with the Rock type.\"},\"grassKnot\":{\"name\":\"Grass Knot\",\"effect\":\"The user snares the target with grass and trips it. The heavier the target, the greater the move\u2019s power (ranging between 20 and 120).\"},\"chatter\":{\"name\":\"Chatter\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with sound waves of deafening chatter. This also confuses the target.\"},\"judgment\":{\"name\":\"Judgment\",\"effect\":\"The user releases countless shots of light at the target. This move\u2019s type changes depending on the kind of Plate or Memory Disc the user is holding, if it has the Multitype or RKS System ability.\"},\"bugBite\":{\"name\":\"Bug Bite\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by biting the target. If the target is holding a Berry, the user eats it and gains its effect.\"},\"chargeBeam\":{\"name\":\"Charge Beam\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with an electric charge. The residual electricity has a 70% chance of boosting the user\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"woodHammer\":{\"name\":\"Wood Hammer\",\"effect\":\"The user slams its rugged body into the target to attack. The user takes \u2153 of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"aquaJet\":{\"name\":\"Aqua Jet\",\"effect\":\"The user lunges at the target to inflict damage, moving at blinding speed. This move always goes first.\"},\"attackOrder\":{\"name\":\"Attack Order\",\"effect\":\"The user calls out its underlings to pummel the target. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"defendOrder\":{\"name\":\"Defend Order\",\"effect\":\"The user calls out its underlings to shield its body, boosting its Defense and Sp. Def stats.\"},\"healOrder\":{\"name\":\"Heal Order\",\"effect\":\"The user calls out its underlings to heal it, restoring \u00bd of its max HP.\"},\"headSmash\":{\"name\":\"Head Smash\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with a hazardous full-power headbutt. The user takes \u00bd of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"doubleHit\":{\"name\":\"Double Hit\",\"effect\":\"The user slams the target with a tail or the like. The target is hit twice in a row.\"},\"roarOfTime\":{\"name\":\"Roar of Time\",\"effect\":\"The user blasts the target with power that distorts even time. The user can\u2019t move on the next turn.\"},\"spacialRend\":{\"name\":\"Spacial Rend\",\"effect\":\"The user tears the target along with the space around it. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"lunarDance\":{\"name\":\"Lunar Dance\",\"effect\":\"The user faints. In return, the Pok\u00e9mon taking its place will have its HP and PP restored and its status conditions cured.\"},\"crushGrip\":{\"name\":\"Crush Grip\",\"effect\":\"The target is crushed with great force. The more HP the target has left, the greater the move\u2019s power (ranging between 1 and 120).\"},\"magmaStorm\":{\"name\":\"Magma Storm\",\"effect\":\"The user traps the target inside a maelstrom of fire. For 4-5 turns, the target takes damage equal to \u215b of its max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"darkVoid\":{\"name\":\"Dark Void\",\"effect\":\"Opposing Pok\u00e9mon are dragged into a world of total darkness that puts them to sleep.\"},\"seedFlare\":{\"name\":\"Seed Flare\",\"effect\":\"The user emits a shock wave from its body to attack its target. This move has a 40% chance of harshly lowering the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"ominousWind\":{\"name\":\"Ominous Wind\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with a gust of horrible wind that makes the target\u2019s skin crawl. This has a 10% chance of boosting the user\u2019s Attack, Defense, Sp. Atk, Sp. Def, and Speed stats all at once.\"},\"shadowForce\":{\"name\":\"Shadow Force\",\"effect\":\"The user disappears on the first turn, then attacks on the next turn. This move can hit a target using a move such as Protect or Detect and removes the effects of those moves.\"},\"honeClaws\":{\"name\":\"Hone Claws\",\"effect\":\"The user sharpens its claws to boost its Attack stat and accuracy.\"},\"wideGuard\":{\"name\":\"Wide Guard\",\"effect\":\"During the turn this move is used, the user protects its side from moves that target all allies.\"},\"guardSplit\":{\"name\":\"Guard Split\",\"effect\":\"The user employs its psychic power to add its Defense and Sp. Def stats to the target\u2019s, then splits the total in half for them to share.\"},\"powerSplit\":{\"name\":\"Power Split\",\"effect\":\"The user employs its psychic power to add its Attack and Sp. Atk stats to the target\u2019s, then splits the total in half for them to share.\"},\"wonderRoom\":{\"name\":\"Wonder Room\",\"effect\":\"The user creates a bizarre area in which Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Defense and Sp. Def stats are swapped for 5 turns.\"},\"psyshock\":{\"name\":\"Psyshock\",\"effect\":\"The user materializes an odd psychic wave to attack the target. This move deals physical damage.\"},\"venoshock\":{\"name\":\"Venoshock\",\"effect\":\"The user drenches the target in a special poisonous liquid. This move\u2019s power is doubled if the target is poisoned or badly poisoned.\"},\"autotomize\":{\"name\":\"Autotomize\",\"effect\":\"The user sheds part of its body to make itself lighter. This sharply boosts the user\u2019s Speed stat.\"},\"ragePowder\":{\"name\":\"Rage Powder\",\"effect\":\"The user scatters a cloud of irritating powder to draw attention to itself, making all opposing Pok\u00e9mon take aim only at the user. Grass-type Pok\u00e9mon are unaffected.\"},\"telekinesis\":{\"name\":\"Telekinesis\",\"effect\":\"The user makes the target float with its psychic power for 3 turns. The target is immune to Ground-type moves while floating, but moves used against it are sure to hit (except for one-hit KO moves).\"},\"magicRoom\":{\"name\":\"Magic Room\",\"effect\":\"The user creates a bizarre area in which Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s held items lose their effects for 5 turns.\"},\"smackDown\":{\"name\":\"Smack Down\",\"effect\":\"The user throws a stone or similar projectile to attack the target. This move can hit opposing Pok\u00e9mon that are in the air, including those using Fly, Bounce, or Sky Drop, knocking them down to the ground.\"},\"stormThrow\":{\"name\":\"Storm Throw\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by striking the target with a fierce blow. This move always lands a critical hit.\"},\"flameBurst\":{\"name\":\"Flame Burst\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with a bursting flame. Pok\u00e9mon next to the target also take damage equal to \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of their max HP.\"},\"sludgeWave\":{\"name\":\"Sludge Wave\",\"effect\":\"The user strikes everything around it by swamping the area with a giant sludge wave. This move has a 10% chance of poisoning targets.\"},\"quiverDance\":{\"name\":\"Quiver Dance\",\"effect\":\"The user lightly performs a beautiful, mystic dance. This boosts the user\u2019s Sp. Atk, Sp. Def, and Speed stats.\"},\"heavySlam\":{\"name\":\"Heavy Slam\",\"effect\":\"The user slams into the target with its heavy body. The more the user outweighs the target, the greater the move\u2019s power (ranging between 40 and 120). If the target has used Minimize, this move\u2019s power is doubled and it will be sure to hit.\"},\"synchronoise\":{\"name\":\"Synchronoise\",\"effect\":\"Using an odd shock wave, the user inflicts damage on any Pok\u00e9mon of the same type in the area around it.\"},\"electroBall\":{\"name\":\"Electro Ball\",\"effect\":\"The user hurls an electric orb at the target. The higher the user\u2019s Speed stat compared to the target\u2019s, the greater this move\u2019s power (ranging between 40 and 150).\"},\"soak\":{\"name\":\"Soak\",\"effect\":\"The user shoots a torrent of water that changes the target\u2019s type to Water.\"},\"flameCharge\":{\"name\":\"Flame Charge\",\"effect\":\"Cloaking itself in flame, the user attacks the target. Then, building up momentum, the user boosts its Speed stat.\"},\"coil\":{\"name\":\"Coil\",\"effect\":\"The user coils up and concentrates. This boosts its Attack and Defense stats as well as its accuracy.\"},\"lowSweep\":{\"name\":\"Low Sweep\",\"effect\":\"The user makes a swift attack on the target\u2019s legs, which lowers the target\u2019s Speed stat.\"},\"acidSpray\":{\"name\":\"Acid Spray\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by spitting fluid that works to melt the target. This also harshly lowers the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"foulPlay\":{\"name\":\"Foul Play\",\"effect\":\"The user turns the target\u2019s strength against it. The damage dealt by this move is determined using the target\u2019s Attack stat instead of the user\u2019s Attack stat.\"},\"simpleBeam\":{\"name\":\"Simple Beam\",\"effect\":\"The user emits a mysterious psychic wave that changes the target\u2019s Ability to Simple.\"},\"entrainment\":{\"name\":\"Entrainment\",\"effect\":\"The user dances with an odd rhythm that compels the target to mimic it, making the target\u2019s Ability the same as the user\u2019s.\"},\"afterYou\":{\"name\":\"After You\",\"effect\":\"The user helps the target and makes it use its move right after the user.\"},\"round\":{\"name\":\"Round\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with a song. If others use this move, they will act immediately after the initial user, and the power of their Rounds will be doubled.\"},\"echoedVoice\":{\"name\":\"Echoed Voice\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with an echoing voice. This move\u2019s power is increased by 40 each turn this move is used consecutively by any Pok\u00e9mon, up to a max of 200.\"},\"chipAway\":{\"name\":\"Chip Away\",\"effect\":\"Looking for an opening, the user strikes consistently. This move ignores the target\u2019s stat changes when dealing damage.\"},\"clearSmog\":{\"name\":\"Clear Smog\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target by throwing a clump of special mud. All stat changes are eliminated.\"},\"storedPower\":{\"name\":\"Stored Power\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with stored power. This move\u2019s power is increased by 20 for each stage that the user\u2019s stats have been boosted.\"},\"quickGuard\":{\"name\":\"Quick Guard\",\"effect\":\"The user protects itself and its allies from priority moves.\"},\"allySwitch\":{\"name\":\"Ally Switch\",\"effect\":\"The user teleports using a strange power and switches places with one of its allies. With each consecutive use, this move\u2019s chance of success becomes \u2153 of what it was before.\"},\"scald\":{\"name\":\"Scald\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by shooting boiling hot water at the target. This move has a 30% chance of burning the target and will thaw out the user or target if one is frozen.\"},\"shellSmash\":{\"name\":\"Shell Smash\",\"effect\":\"The user breaks its shell, which lowers its Defense and Sp. Def stats but sharply boosts its Attack, Sp. Atk, and Speed stats.\"},\"healPulse\":{\"name\":\"Heal Pulse\",\"effect\":\"The user emits a healing pulse that restores \u00bd of the target\u2019s max HP.\"},\"hex\":{\"name\":\"Hex\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with relentless intensity. This move\u2019s power is doubled if the target has a status condition.\"},\"skyDrop\":{\"name\":\"Sky Drop\",\"effect\":\"The user takes the target into the sky on the first turn, then drops it during the next turn. The target cannot attack while in the sky.\"},\"shiftGear\":{\"name\":\"Shift Gear\",\"effect\":\"The user rotates its gears, boosting its Attack stat and sharply boosting its Speed stat.\"},\"circleThrow\":{\"name\":\"Circle Throw\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks last. In return, the target is thrown and a different Pok\u00e9mon is dragged out. In the wild, this ends a battle against a single Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"incinerate\":{\"name\":\"Incinerate\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks opposing Pok\u00e9mon with fire. If a Pok\u00e9mon is holding a certain item, such as a Berry, the item becomes burned up and unusable.\"},\"quash\":{\"name\":\"Quash\",\"effect\":\"The user suppresses the target and makes its move go last.\"},\"acrobatics\":{\"name\":\"Acrobatics\",\"effect\":\"The user nimbly strikes the target. The fewer held items, the higher the damage it inflicts (ranging between 55 and 110).\"},\"reflectType\":{\"name\":\"Reflect Type\",\"effect\":\"The user reflects the target\u2019s type to become the same type as the target.\"},\"retaliate\":{\"name\":\"Retaliate\",\"effect\":\"The user takes revenge for a fainted ally. This move\u2019s power is doubled if an ally fainted in the previous turn.\"},\"finalGambit\":{\"name\":\"Final Gambit\",\"effect\":\"The user risks everything to attack the target. The user faints but inflicts damage equal to its remaining HP at the time this move was used.\"},\"bestow\":{\"name\":\"Bestow\",\"effect\":\"The user passes a held item to the target.\"},\"inferno\":{\"name\":\"Inferno\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by engulfing the target in an intense fire. This leaves the target with a burn.\"},\"waterPledge\":{\"name\":\"Water Pledge\",\"effect\":\"A column of water hits the target. When used alongside Fire Pledge or Grass Pledge, the moves will combine for 150 base power and summon a rainbow or vast swamp, respectively, for 4 turns.\"},\"firePledge\":{\"name\":\"Fire Pledge\",\"effect\":\"A column of fire hits the target. When used alongside Water Pledge or Grass Pledge, the moves will combine for 150 base power and summon a rainbow or vast sea of fire, respectively, for 4 turns.\"},\"grassPledge\":{\"name\":\"Grass Pledge\",\"effect\":\"A column of grass hits the target. When used alongside Water Pledge or Fire Pledge, the moves will combine for 150 base power and summon a vast swamp or sea of fire, respectively, for 4 turns.\"},\"voltSwitch\":{\"name\":\"Volt Switch\",\"effect\":\"After making its attack, the user rushes back to switch places with a party Pok\u00e9mon in waiting.\"},\"struggleBug\":{\"name\":\"Struggle Bug\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by struggling against opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This also lowers their Sp. Atk stats.\"},\"bulldoze\":{\"name\":\"Bulldoze\",\"effect\":\"The user strikes everything around it by stomping down on the ground. This lowers the Speed stats of those hit.\"},\"frostBreath\":{\"name\":\"Frost Breath\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by blowing its cold breath on the target. This move always lands a critical hit.\"},\"dragonTail\":{\"name\":\"Dragon Tail\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks last. In return, the target is knocked away and a different Pok\u00e9mon is dragged out. In the wild, this ends a battle against a single Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"workUp\":{\"name\":\"Work Up\",\"effect\":\"The user is roused, and its Attack and Sp. Atk stats are boosted.\"},\"electroweb\":{\"name\":\"Electroweb\",\"effect\":\"The user captures opposing Pok\u00e9mon in an electric net to inflict damage. This also lowers their Speed stats.\"},\"wildCharge\":{\"name\":\"Wild Charge\",\"effect\":\"The user shrouds itself in electricity and smashes into its target. The user takes \u00bc of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"drillRun\":{\"name\":\"Drill Run\",\"effect\":\"The user crashes into the target while rotating its body like a drill. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"dualChop\":{\"name\":\"Dual Chop\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks its target by hitting it with brutal strikes. The target is hit twice in a row.\"},\"heartStamp\":{\"name\":\"Heart Stamp\",\"effect\":\"The user unleashes a vicious blow after its cute act makes the target less wary. This move has a 30% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"hornLeech\":{\"name\":\"Horn Leech\",\"effect\":\"The user drains the target\u2019s energy with its horns. The user\u2019s HP is restored by \u00bd of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"sacredSword\":{\"name\":\"Sacred Sword\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by slicing with a sword. This move ignores the target\u2019s stat changes when dealing damage.\"},\"razorShell\":{\"name\":\"Razor Shell\",\"effect\":\"The user cuts the target with sharp shells to inflict damage. This move has a 50% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Defense stat.\"},\"heatCrash\":{\"name\":\"Heat Crash\",\"effect\":\"The user slams into the target with its flame-covered body. The more the user outweighs the target, the greater the move\u2019s power (ranging between 40 and 120). If the target has used Minimize, this move\u2019s power is doubled and it will be sure to hit.\"},\"leafTornado\":{\"name\":\"Leaf Tornado\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks its target by encircling it in sharp leaves. This move has a 50% chance of lowering the target\u2019s accuracy.\"},\"steamroller\":{\"name\":\"Steamroller\",\"effect\":\"The user crushes its target by rolling over the target with its rolled-up body. This move has a 30% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"cottonGuard\":{\"name\":\"Cotton Guard\",\"effect\":\"The user protects itself by wrapping its body in soft cotton, drastically boosting its Defense stat.\"},\"nightDaze\":{\"name\":\"Night Daze\",\"effect\":\"The user looses a pitch-black shock wave at the target to inflict damage. This move has a 40% chance of lowering the target\u2019s accuracy.\"},\"psystrike\":{\"name\":\"Psystrike\",\"effect\":\"The user materializes an odd psychic wave to attack the target. This move deals physical damage.\"},\"tailSlap\":{\"name\":\"Tail Slap\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by striking the target with its hard tail. This move hits 2-5 times in a row.\"},\"hurricane\":{\"name\":\"Hurricane\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by wrapping its opponent in a fierce wind. This move has a 30% chance of confusing the target and never misses in rain. In harsh sunlight, this move\u2019s accuracy is 50%. This move can hit a target that\u2019s in the air from Fly, Bounce, or Sky Drop.\"},\"headCharge\":{\"name\":\"Head Charge\",\"effect\":\"The user charges its head into the target, using its powerful guard hair. The user takes \u00bc of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"gearGrind\":{\"name\":\"Gear Grind\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by throwing steel gears at the target twice in a row.\"},\"searingShot\":{\"name\":\"Searing Shot\",\"effect\":\"The user torches everything around it in an inferno of scarlet flames. This move has a 30% chance of burning targets.\"},\"technoBlast\":{\"name\":\"Techno Blast\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by firing a beam of light at the target. When used by Genesect, this move\u2019s type changes depending on the Drive being held.\"},\"relicSong\":{\"name\":\"Relic Song\",\"effect\":\"The user sings an ancient song and attacks by appealing to the hearts of the listening opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This move has a 10% chance of putting the target to sleep. If used by Meloetta, it will cause it to swap between its Aria and Pirouette Formes.\"},\"secretSword\":{\"name\":\"Secret Sword\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by slashing targets with a long sword. The odd power contained in the sword does physical damage to the target. If a Keldeo knows this move, it will transform into its Resolute form.\"},\"glaciate\":{\"name\":\"Glaciate\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by blowing freezing cold air at opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This also lowers their Speed stats.\"},\"boltStrike\":{\"name\":\"Bolt Strike\",\"effect\":\"The user surrounds itself with a great amount of electricity and charges the target. This move has a 20% chance of paralyzing the target.\"},\"blueFlare\":{\"name\":\"Blue Flare\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by engulfing the target in an intense, yet beautiful, blue flame. This move has a 20% chance of burning the target.\"},\"fieryDance\":{\"name\":\"Fiery Dance\",\"effect\":\"Cloaked in flames, the user dances and attacks the target. This move has a 50% chance of boosting the user\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"freezeShock\":{\"name\":\"Freeze Shock\",\"effect\":\"The turn after using this move, the user hits the target with electrically charged ice to inflict damage. This move has a 30% chance of paralyzing the target.\"},\"iceBurn\":{\"name\":\"Ice Burn\",\"effect\":\"The turn after using this move, the user surrounds the target with an ultracold, freezing wind to inflict damage. This move has a 30% chance of burning the target.\"},\"snarl\":{\"name\":\"Snarl\",\"effect\":\"The user snarls incessantly at targets, lowering the Sp. Atk stats of opposing Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"icicleCrash\":{\"name\":\"Icicle Crash\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by crashing large icicles onto the target. This move has a 30% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"vCreate\":{\"name\":\"V-create\",\"effect\":\"The user emits a hot flame from its forehead and hurls itself at the target to inflict damage. This also lowers the user\u2019s Defense, Sp. Def, and Speed stats.\"},\"fusionFlare\":{\"name\":\"Fusion Flare\",\"effect\":\"The user brings down a giant flame. This move\u2019s power is doubled if used after Fusion Bolt. The user is thawed out if it is frozen.\"},\"fusionBolt\":{\"name\":\"Fusion Bolt\",\"effect\":\"The user throws down a giant lightning bolt. This move\u2019s power is doubled if used after Fusion Flare.\"},\"flyingPress\":{\"name\":\"Flying Press\",\"effect\":\"The user dives down onto the target from the sky. This move is Fighting and Flying type simultaneously. If the target has used Minimize, this move\u2019s power is doubled and it will be sure to hit.\"},\"matBlock\":{\"name\":\"Mat Block\",\"effect\":\"Using a pulled-up mat as a shield, the user protects itself and its allies from damaging moves. This move does not stop status moves and will fail unless it is the first move used by the user after it enters a battle.\"},\"belch\":{\"name\":\"Belch\",\"effect\":\"The user lets out a damaging belch at the target. The user must eat a held Berry to use this move.\"},\"rototiller\":{\"name\":\"Rototiller\",\"effect\":\"Tilling the soil, the user makes it easier for plants to grow. This boosts the Attack and Sp. Atk stats of all grounded Grass-type Pok\u00e9mon in battle.\"},\"stickyWeb\":{\"name\":\"Sticky Web\",\"effect\":\"The user weaves a sticky net around the opposing team. Pok\u00e9mon that switch into battle will have their Speed stats lowered. Pok\u00e9mon such as Flying types or ones with the Levitate Ability are unaffected.\"},\"fellStinger\":{\"name\":\"Fell Stinger\",\"effect\":\"When the user knocks out a target with this move, the user\u2019s Attack stat is boosted drastically.\"},\"phantomForce\":{\"name\":\"Phantom Force\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by disappearing into the shadows for a short time, then surfacing to strike the target on the next turn. This move can hit a target using a move such as Protect or Detect and removes the effects of those moves.\"},\"trickOrTreat\":{\"name\":\"Trick-or-Treat\",\"effect\":\"The user invites targets to go trick-or-treating. This adds the Ghost type to the target\u2019s type.\"},\"nobleRoar\":{\"name\":\"Noble Roar\",\"effect\":\"Letting out a noble roar, the user intimidates the target and lowers the target\u2019s Attack and Sp. Atk stats.\"},\"ionDeluge\":{\"name\":\"Ion Deluge\",\"effect\":\"The user disperses electrically charged particles, which changes Normal-type moves to Electric-type moves.\"},\"parabolicCharge\":{\"name\":\"Parabolic Charge\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by unleashing a wave of electricity. The user\u2019s HP is restored by \u00bd of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"forestsCurse\":{\"name\":\"Forest\u2019s Curse\",\"effect\":\"The user places the curse of the forest on targets. This adds the Grass type to the target\u2019s type.\"},\"petalBlizzard\":{\"name\":\"Petal Blizzard\",\"effect\":\"The user stirs up a violent petal blizzard and damages everything around it.\"},\"freezeDry\":{\"name\":\"Freeze-Dry\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by rapidly lowering the target\u2019s temperature. This move is super effective on Water-type Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"disarmingVoice\":{\"name\":\"Disarming Voice\",\"effect\":\"Letting out a charming cry, the user does emotional damage to opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This attack never misses.\"},\"partingShot\":{\"name\":\"Parting Shot\",\"effect\":\"With a parting threat, the user lowers the target\u2019s Attack and Sp. Atk stats. The user then switches out of battle to be replaced by another party Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"topsyTurvy\":{\"name\":\"Topsy-Turvy\",\"effect\":\"All stat changes affecting the target turn topsy-turvy and become the opposite of what they were.\"},\"drainingKiss\":{\"name\":\"Draining Kiss\",\"effect\":\"The user steals the target\u2019s HP with a kiss. The user\u2019s HP is restored by \u00be of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"craftyShield\":{\"name\":\"Crafty Shield\",\"effect\":\"The user protects itself and its allies from status moves with a mysterious power. This does not stop moves that do damage.\"},\"flowerShield\":{\"name\":\"Flower Shield\",\"effect\":\"The user boosts the Defense stats of all Grass-type Pok\u00e9mon in battle with a mysterious power.\"},\"grassyTerrain\":{\"name\":\"Grassy Terrain\",\"effect\":\"Turns the entire field into Grassy Terrain for 5 turns. Pok\u00e9mon on the ground have their Grass-type moves boosted by 30% and restore \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of their max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"mistyTerrain\":{\"name\":\"Misty Terrain\",\"effect\":\"Turns the entire field into Misty Terrain for 5 turns. Pok\u00e9mon on the ground are protected from status conditions and receive half the damage dealt by Dragon-type moves.\"},\"electrify\":{\"name\":\"Electrify\",\"effect\":\"If this move hits the target before it uses a move, its move becomes Electric type for that turn.\"},\"playRough\":{\"name\":\"Play Rough\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by playing rough with the target. This move has a 10% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Attack stat.\"},\"fairyWind\":{\"name\":\"Fairy Wind\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by stirring up a fairy wind to strike the target.\"},\"moonblast\":{\"name\":\"Moonblast\",\"effect\":\"Borrowing the power of the moon, the user attacks the target. This move has 10% chance of lowering the target\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"boomburst\":{\"name\":\"Boomburst\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks everything around it with the destructive power of a terrible explosive sound.\"},\"fairyLock\":{\"name\":\"Fairy Lock\",\"effect\":\"By locking down the battlefield, the user keeps all Pok\u00e9mon from fleeing or switching out of battle during the next turn.\"},\"kingsShield\":{\"name\":\"King\u2019s Shield\",\"effect\":\"The user takes a defensive stance while it protects itself from damage. Any attackers that use contact moves against the user during this turn will have their Attack stats lowered. With each consecutive use, this move\u2019s chance of success becomes \u2153 of what it was before.\"},\"playNice\":{\"name\":\"Play Nice\",\"effect\":\"The user and the target become friends, and the target loses its will to fight. This lowers the target\u2019s Attack stat.\"},\"confide\":{\"name\":\"Confide\",\"effect\":\"The user tells the target a secret, and the target loses its ability to concentrate. This lowers the target\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"diamondStorm\":{\"name\":\"Diamond Storm\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by engulfing targets in a storm of diamonds. This move has a 50% chance to sharply boost the user\u2019s Defense stat.\"},\"steamEruption\":{\"name\":\"Steam Eruption\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by immersing targets in superheated steam. This move has a 30% chance of burning the target and will thaw out the user or target if one is frozen.\"},\"hyperspaceHole\":{\"name\":\"Hyperspace Hole\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by using a hyperspace hole to appear right near targets without warning. This attack can hit a target using a move such as Protect or Detect.\"},\"waterShuriken\":{\"name\":\"Water Shuriken\",\"effect\":\"The user hits the target with throwing stars 2-5 times in a row. This move always goes first. When used by Ash-Greninja, this move\u2019s power is increased to 20 and will always strike 3 times in a row.\"},\"mysticalFire\":{\"name\":\"Mystical Fire\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by breathing a special kind of searing flame. This also lowers the target\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"spikyShield\":{\"name\":\"Spiky Shield\",\"effect\":\"The user protects itself from incoming moves for the turn. Any attackers that use contact moves against the user during this turn take damage equal to \u215b of their max HP. With each consecutive use, this move\u2019s chance of success becomes \u2153 of what it was before.\"},\"aromaticMist\":{\"name\":\"Aromatic Mist\",\"effect\":\"The user boosts the Sp. Def stat of an ally Pok\u00e9mon by using a mysterious aroma.\"},\"eerieImpulse\":{\"name\":\"Eerie Impulse\",\"effect\":\"The user\u2019s body generates an eerie impulse. Exposing the target to it harshly lowers the target\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"venomDrench\":{\"name\":\"Venom Drench\",\"effect\":\"Opposing Pok\u00e9mon are drenched in an odd poisonous liquid. This lowers the Attack, Sp. Atk, and Speed stats of a poisoned target.\"},\"powder\":{\"name\":\"Powder\",\"effect\":\"The user covers the target in a combustible powder. If the target uses a Fire-type move, the powder explodes and the target takes damages equal to \u00bc of their max HP.\"},\"geomancy\":{\"name\":\"Geomancy\",\"effect\":\"The user absorbs energy on the first turn, then sharply boosts its Sp. Atk, Sp. Def, and Speed stats on the next turn.\"},\"magneticFlux\":{\"name\":\"Magnetic Flux\",\"effect\":\"The user manipulates magnetic fields, which boosts the Defense and Sp. Def stats of ally Pok\u00e9mon with the Plus Ability or the Minus Ability.\"},\"happyHour\":{\"name\":\"Happy Hour\",\"effect\":\"Using Happy Hour doubles the amount of prize money received after battle.\"},\"electricTerrain\":{\"name\":\"Electric Terrain\",\"effect\":\"The user turns the ground into Electric Terrain for 5 turns. Pok\u00e9mon on the ground have their Electric-type moves boosted by 30% and cannot be put to sleep.\"},\"dazzlingGleam\":{\"name\":\"Dazzling Gleam\",\"effect\":\"The user damages opposing Pok\u00e9mon by emitting a powerful flash.\"},\"celebrate\":{\"name\":\"Celebrate\",\"effect\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon congratulates you on your special day!\"},\"holdHands\":{\"name\":\"Hold Hands\",\"effect\":\"The user and an ally hold hands. This makes them very happy.\"},\"babyDollEyes\":{\"name\":\"Baby-Doll Eyes\",\"effect\":\"The user stares at the target with its baby-doll eyes, which lowers the target\u2019s Attack stat. This move always goes first.\"},\"nuzzle\":{\"name\":\"Nuzzle\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by nuzzling its electrified cheeks against the target. This paralyzes the target.\"},\"holdBack\":{\"name\":\"Hold Back\",\"effect\":\"The user holds back when it attacks, and the target is left with at least 1 HP.\"},\"infestation\":{\"name\":\"Infestation\",\"effect\":\"The target is infested and attacked. For 4-5 turns, the target takes damage equal to \u215b of its max HP at the end of every turn. The target can\u2019t flee or be switched out of battle during this time.\"},\"powerUpPunch\":{\"name\":\"Power-Up Punch\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks targets with a punch that will make its own fist tougher. This boosts the user\u2019s Attack stat.\"},\"oblivionWing\":{\"name\":\"Oblivion Wing\",\"effect\":\"The user unleashes a wave of destruction to absorb HP from target. The user\u2019s HP is restored by \u00be of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"thousandArrows\":{\"name\":\"Thousand Arrows\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by generating countless arrows from its internal energy and raining them down upon targets. This move can hit opposing Pok\u00e9mon that are in the air, including those using Fly, Bounce, or Sky Drop, knocking them down to the ground.\"},\"thousandWaves\":{\"name\":\"Thousand Waves\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by unleashing a wave that crawls along the ground. Any Pok\u00e9mon hit by the wave cannot flee or be switched out of battle.\"},\"landsWrath\":{\"name\":\"Land\u2019s Wrath\",\"effect\":\"The user gathers the energy of the land and focuses that power on opposing Pok\u00e9mon to inflict damage.\"},\"lightOfRuin\":{\"name\":\"Light of Ruin\",\"effect\":\"Drawing in mystical energy, the user fires a powerful beam of light. The user takes \u00bd of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"originPulse\":{\"name\":\"Origin Pulse\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks opposing Pok\u00e9mon with countless beams of light that glow a deep and brilliant blue.\"},\"precipiceBlades\":{\"name\":\"Precipice Blades\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks opposing Pok\u00e9mon by manifesting the power of the land in fearsome blades of stone.\"},\"dragonAscent\":{\"name\":\"Dragon Ascent\",\"effect\":\"After soaring upward, the user attacks the target by dropping out of the sky at high speed. This also lowers the user\u2019s Defense and Sp. Def stats.\"},\"hyperspaceFury\":{\"name\":\"Hyperspace Fury\",\"effect\":\"Using its many arms, the user unleashes a barrage of attacks that ignore the effects of moves like Protect and Detect. This 