ng a battle.\"},\"banefulBunker\":{\"name\":\"Baneful Bunker\",\"effect\":\"The user protects itself from incoming moves for the turn. Any attackers that use contact moves against the user during this turn become poisoned. With each consecutive use, this move\u2019s chance of success becomes \u2153 of what it was before.\"},\"spiritShackle\":{\"name\":\"Spirit Shackle\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks while simultaneously stitching the target\u2019s shadow to the ground to prevent the target from fleeing or switching out of battle.\"},\"darkestLariat\":{\"name\":\"Darkest Lariat\",\"effect\":\"The user swings both arms and hits the target. This move ignores the target\u2019s stat changes when dealing damage.\"},\"sparklingAria\":{\"name\":\"Sparkling Aria\",\"effect\":\"The user bursts into song, emitting many bubbles. Any Pok\u00e9mon suffering from a burn will be cured by the touch of these bubbles.\"},\"iceHammer\":{\"name\":\"Ice Hammer\",\"effect\":\"The user swings its strong, heavy fist at the target to inflict damage. This also lowers the user\u2019s Speed stat.\"},\"floralHealing\":{\"name\":\"Floral Healing\",\"effect\":\"The user restores \u00bd of the target\u2019s max HP. When the ground is Grassy Terrain, \u2154 of the target\u2019s max HP is restored instead.\"},\"highHorsepower\":{\"name\":\"High Horsepower\",\"effect\":\"The user fiercely attacks the target using its entire body.\"},\"strengthSap\":{\"name\":\"Strength Sap\",\"effect\":\"The user restores its own HP by the same amount as the target\u2019s Attack stat. It then lowers the target\u2019s Attack stat.\"},\"solarBlade\":{\"name\":\"Solar Blade\",\"effect\":\"The user gathers light on the first turn, then fills a blade with the light\u2019s energy and attacks on the next turn. In harsh sunlight, the user can attack immediately. This move\u2019s power is halved in any other weather condition.\"},\"leafage\":{\"name\":\"Leafage\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by pelting the target with leaves.