fect\":\"The user swaps its Attack and Defense stats.\"},\"stoneAxe\":{\"name\":\"Stone Axe\",\"effect\":\"The user swings its stone axes at the target, leaving behind stone splinters that float around the opposing team. Any Pok\u00e9mon that switch into battle will take damage equal to \u215b of their max HP. The damage of these rocks differ depending on the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s type matchup with the Rock type.\"},\"springtideStorm\":{\"name\":\"Springtide Storm\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by wrapping opposing Pok\u00e9mon in fierce winds brimming with love and hate. This move has a 30% chance of lowering the Attack stats of opposing Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"mysticalPower\":{\"name\":\"Mystical Power\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by emitting a mysterious power. This also boosts the user\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"ragingFury\":{\"name\":\"Raging Fury\",\"effect\":\"The user rampages around spewing flames for 2-3 turns. The user then becomes confused.\"},\"waveCrash\":{\"name\":\"Wave Crash\",\"effect\":\"The user shrouds itself in water and slams into the target with its whole body to inflict damage. The user takes \u2153 of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"chloroblast\":{\"name\":\"Chloroblast\",\"effect\":\"The user launches its amassed chlorophyll to inflict damage on the target. After attacking, the user takes damage equal to \u00bd of its max HP.\"},\"mountainGale\":{\"name\":\"Mountain Gale\",\"effect\":\"The user hurls giant chunks of ice at the target to inflict damage. This move has a 30% chance of making the target flinch.\"},\"victoryDance\":{\"name\":\"Victory Dance\",\"effect\":\"The user performs an intense dance to usher in victory, boosting its Attack, Defense, and Speed stats.\"},\"headlongRush\":{\"name\":\"Headlong Rush\",\"effect\":\"The user smashes into the target in a full-body tackle. This also lowers the user\u2019s Defense and Sp. Def stats.\"},\"barbBarrage\":{\"name\":\"Barb Barrage\",\"effect\":\"The user launches countless toxic barbs 