Max Cuddle\",\"effect\":\"A Normal-type attack that Gigantamax Eevee use. This move infatuates opponents.\"},\"gMaxReplenish\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Replenish\",\"effect\":\"A Normal-type attack that Gigantamax Snorlax use. This move has a 50% chance to restore Berries consumed by the user or its allies.\"},\"gMaxMalodor\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Malodor\",\"effect\":\"A Poison-type attack that Gigantamax Garbodor use. This move poisons opponents.\"},\"gMaxStonesurge\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Stonesurge\",\"effect\":\"A Water-type attack that Gigantamax Drednaw use. This move scatters sharp rocks around the field, inflicting damage to opposing Pok\u00e9mon that switch into battle equal to \u215b of their max HP. The damage of these rocks differ depending on the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s type matchup with the Rock type.\"},\"gMaxWindRage\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Wind Rage\",\"effect\":\"A Flying-type attack that Gigantamax Corviknight use. This move removes the target\u2019s barriers such as Light Screen, Reflect, Aurora Veil, or Safeguard, as well as any entry hazards or terrain from the field. This can also clear deep fog.\"},\"gMaxStunShock\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Stun Shock\",\"effect\":\"An Electric-type attack that Gigantamax Toxtricity use. This move poisons or paralyzes opponents.\"},\"gMaxFinale\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Finale\",\"effect\":\"A Fairy-type attack that Gigantamax Alcremie use. This move restores \u2159 of the max HP of the user and its allies.\"},\"gMaxDepletion\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Depletion\",\"effect\":\"A Dragon-type attack that Gigantamax Duraludon use. Reduces the PP of the move last used by the target by 2.\"},\"gMaxGravitas\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Gravitas\",\"effect\":\"A Psychic-type attack that Gigantamax Orbeetle use. This move changes gravity for 5 turns, boosting the accuracy of moves by 67% and grounding Flying types or Pok\u00e9mon with Levitate.\"},\"gMaxVolcalith\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Volcalith\",\"effect\":\"A Rock-type attack that Gigantamax Coalossal use. For 4 turns, this move continues to deal damage to non-Rock type opponents equal to \u2159 of their max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"gMaxSandblast\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Sandblast\",\"effect\":\"A Ground-type attack that Gigantamax Sandaconda use. Opponents are trapped in a raging sandstorm that inflicts damage equal to \u215b of their max HP for 4-5 turns\"},\"gMaxSnooze\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Snooze\",\"effect\":\"A Dark-type attack that Gigantamax Grimmsnarl use. The user lets loose a huge yawn that lulls the targets into falling asleep on the next turn.\"},\"gMaxTartness\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Tartness\",\"effect\":\"A Grass-type attack that Gigantamax Flapple use. This move reduces the opponents\u2019 evasiveness.\"},\"gMaxSweetness\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Sweetness\",\"effect\":\"A Grass-type attack that Gigantamax Appletun use. This move heals the status conditions of allies.\"},\"gMaxSmite\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Smite\",\"effect\":\"A Fairy-type attack that Gigantamax Hatterene use. This move confuses opponents.\"},\"gMaxSteelsurge\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Steelsurge\",\"effect\":\"A Steel-type attack that Gigantamax Copperajah use. This move scatters sharp spikes around the field, inflicting damage to opposing Pok\u00e9mon that switch into battle equal to \u215b of their max HP. The damage of these spikes differ depending on the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s type matchup with the Steel type.\"},\"gMaxMeltdown\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Meltdown\",\"effect\":\"A Steel-type attack that Gigantamax Melmetal use. This move makes opponents incapable of using the same move twice in a row.\"},\"gMaxFoamBurst\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Foam Burst\",\"effect\":\"A Water-type attack that Gigantamax Kingler use. This move harshly lowers the Speed of opponents.\"},\"gMaxCentiferno\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Centiferno\",\"effect\":\"A Fire-type attack that Gigantamax Centiskorch use. For 4-5 turns, this move traps opponents in flames that inflict damage equal to \u215b of their max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"gMaxVineLash\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Vine Lash\",\"effect\":\"A Grass-type attack that Gigantamax Venusaur use. For 4 turns, this move continues to deal damage to non-Grass type opponents equal to \u2159 of their max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"gMaxCannonade\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Cannonade\",\"effect\":\"A Water-type attack that Gigantamax Blastoise use. For 4 turns, this move continues to deal damage to non-Water type opponents equal to \u2159 of their max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"gMaxDrumSolo\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Drum Solo\",\"effect\":\"A Grass-type attack that Gigantamax Rillaboom use. This move can ignore the effect of the target\u2019s Ability (with certain exceptions).\"},\"gMaxFireball\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Fireball\",\"effect\":\"A Fire-type attack that Gigantamax Cinderace use. This move can ignore the effect of the target\u2019s Ability (with certain exceptions).\"},\"gMaxHydrosnipe\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Hydrosnipe\",\"effect\":\"A Water-type attack that Gigantamax Inteleon use. This move can ignore the effect of the target\u2019s Ability (with certain exceptions).\"},\"gMaxOneBlow\":{\"name\":\"G-Max One Blow\",\"effect\":\"A Dark-type attack that Gigantamax Urshifu use. This single-strike move can hit a target using a move such as Protect or Detect.\"},\"gMaxRapidFlow\":{\"name\":\"G-Max Rapid Flow\",\"effect\":\"A Water-type attack that Gigantamax Urshifu use. This rapid-strike move can hit a target using a move such as Protect or Detect.\"},\"teraBlast\":{\"name\":\"Tera Blast\",\"effect\":\"If the user has Terastallized, it unleashes energy of its Tera Type. This move inflicts damage using the Attack or Sp. Atk stat\u2014whichever is higher for the user.\"},\"silkTrap\":{\"name\":\"Silk Trap\",\"effect\":\"The user spins a silken trap, protecting itself from damage while lowering the Speed stat of any attacker that makes direct contact. With each consecutive use, this move\u2019s chance of success becomes \u2153 of what it was before.\"},\"axeKick\":{\"name\":\"Axe Kick\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by kicking up into the air and slamming its heel down upon the target. This move has a 30% chance of confusing the target. If this move misses or fails, the user takes damage equal to \u00bd of its max HP instead.\"},\"lastRespects\":{\"name\":\"Last Respects\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks to avenge its allies. This move\u2019s power is increased by 50 for each time that a Pok\u00e9mon in the user\u2019s party has fainted.\"},\"luminaCrash\":{\"name\":\"Lumina Crash\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by unleashing a peculiar light that even affects the mind. This also harshly lowers the target\u2019s Sp. Def stat.\"},\"orderUp\":{\"name\":\"Order Up\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks with elegant poise. If the user has a Tatsugiri in its mouth, this move boosts the user\u2019s stats based on the Tatsugiri\u2019s form: Attack for Curly Tatsugiri, Defense for Droopy, or Speed for Stretchy.\"},\"jetPunch\":{\"name\":\"Jet Punch\",\"effect\":\"The user summons a torrent around its fist and punches at blinding speed. This move always goes first.\"},\"spicyExtract\":{\"name\":\"Spicy Extract\",\"effect\":\"The user emits an incredibly spicy extract, sharply boosting the target\u2019s Attack stat and harshly lowering the target\u2019s Defense stat.\"},\"spinOut\":{\"name\":\"Spin Out\",\"effect\":\"The user spins furiously by straining its legs, inflicting damage on the target. This also harshly lowers the user\u2019s Speed stat.\"},\"populationBomb\":{\"name\":\"Population Bomb\",\"effect\":\"The user\u2019s fellows gather in droves to perform a combo attack that hits the target 1 to 10 times in a row. The attack ends if the user misses.\"},\"iceSpinner\":{\"name\":\"Ice Spinner\",\"effect\":\"The user covers itself in thin ice and twirls around, slamming into the target. This move\u2019s spinning motion also destroys the terrain.\"},\"glaiveRush\":{\"name\":\"Glaive Rush\",\"effect\":\"The user throws its entire body into a reckless charge. After this move is used, attacks on the user cannot miss and will inflict double damage until the user\u2019s next turn.\"},\"revivalBlessing\":{\"name\":\"Revival Blessing\",\"effect\":\"The user bestows a loving blessing, reviving a party Pok\u00e9mon that has fainted and restoring half that Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s max HP.\"},\"saltCure\":{\"name\":\"Salt Cure\",\"effect\":\"The user salt cures the target, inflicting damage equal to \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of the target\u2019s max HP at the end of every turn. Steel and Water types take damage equal to \u215b of their max HP instead.\"},\"tripleDive\":{\"name\":\"Triple Dive\",\"effect\":\"The user performs a perfectly timed triple dive, hitting the target with splashes of water 3 times in a row.\"},\"mortalSpin\":{\"name\":\"Mortal Spin\",\"effect\":\"The user performs a spin attack that can eliminate the effects of binding moves and Leech Seed, as well as any entry hazards on its side. This also poisons opposing Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"doodle\":{\"name\":\"Doodle\",\"effect\":\"The user captures the very essence of the target in a sketch. This changes the Abilities of the user and its ally Pok\u00e9mon to that of the target.\"},\"filletAway\":{\"name\":\"Fillet Away\",\"effect\":\"The user loses \u00bd of its max HP to sharply boost its Attack, Sp. Atk, and Speed stats. This move fails if the user doesn\u2019t have enough remaining HP.\"},\"kowtowCleave\":{\"name\":\"Kowtow Cleave\",\"effect\":\"The user slashes at the target after kowtowing to make the target let down its guard. This attack never misses.\"},\"flowerTrick\":{\"name\":\"Flower Trick\",\"effect\":\"The user throws a rigged bouquet of flowers at the target. This attack never misses and always lands a critical hit.\"},\"torchSong\":{\"name\":\"Torch Song\",\"effect\":\"The user blows out raging flames as if singing a song, scorching the target. This also boosts the user\u2019s Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"aquaStep\":{\"name\":\"Aqua Step\",\"effect\":\"The user toys with the target and attacks it using light and fluid dance steps. This also boosts the user\u2019s Speed stat.\"},\"ragingBull\":{\"name\":\"Raging Bull\",\"effect\":\"The user performs a tackle like a raging bull. It can also break barriers, such as Light Screen and Reflect. When used by Tauros, this move\u2019s type changes depending on its form.\"},\"makeItRain\":{\"name\":\"Make It Rain\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by throwing out a mass of coins. This harshly lowers the user\u2019s Sp. Atk stat. If a target is successfully struck, you will earn money after the battle.\"},\"psyblade\":{\"name\":\"Psyblade\",\"effect\":\"The user rends the target with an ethereal blade. This move\u2019s power is boosted by 50% if the user is on Electric Terrain.\"},\"hydroSteam\":{\"name\":\"Hydro Steam\",\"effect\":\"The user blasts the target with boiling-hot water. This move\u2019s power is not lowered in harsh sunlight but rather boosted by 50%.\"},\"ruination\":{\"name\":\"Ruination\",\"effect\":\"The user summons a ruinous disaster. This deals damage to the target equal to \u00bd of their remaining HP.\"},\"collisionCourse\":{\"name\":\"Collision Course\",\"effect\":\"The user rushes forward and crashes to the ground, causing a massive prehistoric explosion. This move\u2019s power is boosted by 33% if it\u2019s a supereffective hit.\"},\"electroDrift\":{\"name\":\"Electro Drift\",\"effect\":\"The user races forward at ultrafast speeds, piercing its target with futuristic electricity. This move\u2019s power is boosted by 33% if it\u2019s a supereffective hit.\"},\"shedTail\":{\"name\":\"Shed Tail\",\"effect\":\"The user creates a substitute for itself using \u00bd of its max HP before switching places with a party Pok\u00e9mon in waiting.\"},\"chillyReception\":{\"name\":\"Chilly Reception\",\"effect\":\"The user tells a chillingly bad joke before switching places with a party Pok\u00e9mon in waiting. This summons a snowstorm lasting 5 turns.\"},\"tidyUp\":{\"name\":\"Tidy Up\",\"effect\":\"The user tidies up and removes the effects of Spikes, Stealth Rock, Sticky Web, Toxic Spikes, and Substitute. This also boosts the user\u2019s Attack and Speed stats.\"},\"snowscape\":{\"name\":\"Snowscape\",\"effect\":\"The user summons a snowstorm lasting 5 turns. This boosts the Defense stats of Ice types by 50%.\"},\"pounce\":{\"name\":\"Pounce\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by pouncing on the target. This also lowers the target\u2019s Speed stat.\"},\"trailblaze\":{\"name\":\"Trailblaze\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks suddenly as if leaping out from tall grass. The user\u2019s nimble footwork boosts its Speed stat.\"},\"chillingWater\":{\"name\":\"Chilling Water\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target by showering it with water that\u2019s so cold it saps the target\u2019s power. This also lowers the target\u2019s Attack stat.\"},\"hyperDrill\":{\"name\":\"Hyper Drill\",\"effect\":\"The user spins the pointed part of its body at high speed to pierce the target. This attack can hit a target using a move such as Protect or Detect.\"},\"twinBeam\":{\"name\":\"Twin Beam\",\"effect\":\"The user shoots mystical beams from its eyes to inflict damage. The target is hit twice in a row.\"},\"rageFist\":{\"name\":\"Rage Fist\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by converting its rage into energy. This move\u2019s power is increased by 50 each time the user takes damage from a move, up to a maximum power of 350. If the user switches out of battle, the move\u2019s power returns to its usual value.\"},\"armorCannon\":{\"name\":\"Armor Cannon\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by shooting off its own armor as blazing projectiles. This also lowers the user\u2019s Defense and Sp. Def stats.\"},\"bitterBlade\":{\"name\":\"Bitter Blade\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by focusing all its bitter feelings toward this world into the tip of its blade. The user\u2019s HP is restored by \u00bd of the damage dealt by this move.\"},\"doubleShock\":{\"name\":\"Double Shock\",\"effect\":\"The user discharges all the electricity from its body to perform a high-damage attack, and loses the Electric type. This move fails unless it is used by a Electric type.\"},\"gigatonHammer\":{\"name\":\"Gigaton Hammer\",\"effect\":\"The user swings its whole body around to attack with its huge hammer. This move can\u2019t be used twice in a row.\"},\"comeuppance\":{\"name\":\"Comeuppance\",\"effect\":\"The user retaliates to deal 1.5x of the damage it took from an opponent\u2019s move during the turn this move is used.\"},\"aquaCutter\":{\"name\":\"Aqua Cutter\",\"effect\":\"The user expels pressurized water to cut at the target like a blade. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"blazingTorque\":{\"name\":\"Blazing Torque\",\"effect\":\"The user rams into the target with blazing energy. This move has a 30% chance of burning the target.\"},\"wickedTorque\":{\"name\":\"Wicked Torque\",\"effect\":\"The user rams into the target with malicious intent. This move has a 10% chance of putting the target to sleep.\"},\"noxiousTorque\":{\"name\":\"Noxious Torque\",\"effect\":\"The user rams into the target with a poisonous end. This move has a 30% chance of poisoning the target.\"},\"combatTorque\":{\"name\":\"Combat Torque\",\"effect\":\"The user rams into the target with great force. This move has a 30% chance of paralyzing the target.\"},\"magicalTorque\":{\"name\":\"Magical Torque\",\"effect\":\"The user rams into the target with a fae-like force. This move has a 30% chance of confusing the target.\"},\"bloodMoon\":{\"name\":\"Blood Moon\",\"effect\":\"The user unleashes the full brunt of its spirit from a full moon that shines as red as blood. This move can\u2019t be used twice in a row.\"},\"matchaGotcha\":{\"name\":\"Matcha Gotcha\",\"effect\":\"The user fires a blast of tea that it mixed. The user\u2019s HP is restored by \u00bd of the damage dealt by this move, and has a 20% chance of burning targets. This will also thaw out a frozen user or target.\"},\"syrupBomb\":{\"name\":\"Syrup Bomb\",\"effect\":\"The user sets off an explosion of sticky candy syrup, which coats the target and causes the target\u2019s Speed stat to drop at the end of every turn for 3 turns.\"},\"ivyCudgel\":{\"name\":\"Ivy Cudgel\",\"effect\":\"The user strikes with an ivy-wrapped cudgel. This move\u2019s critical-hit ratio is boosted by 1 stage. When used by Ogerpon, this move\u2019s type changes depending on the mask worn.\"},\"electroShot\":{\"name\":\"Electro Shot\",\"effect\":\"The user gathers electricity on the first turn, boosting its Sp. Atk stat, then fires a high-voltage shot on the next turn. The shot will be fired immediately in rain.\"},\"teraStarstorm\":{\"name\":\"Tera Starstorm\",\"effect\":\"With the power of its crystals, the user bombards and eliminates the target. When used by Terapagos in its Stellar Form, this move damages all opposing Pok\u00e9mon. This move inflicts damage using the Attack or Sp. Atk stat\u2014whichever is higher for the user when Terastallized.\"},\"fickleBeam\":{\"name\":\"Fickle Beam\",\"effect\":\"The user shoots a beam of light to inflict damage. There is a 30% chance that all of the user\u2019s heads will shoot beams in unison, doubling the move\u2019s power.\"},\"burningBulwark\":{\"name\":\"Burning Bulwark\",\"effect\":\"The user intensely heats up a part of its body, protecting it from attacks and also causing burns to any attacker that makes direct contact with it.\"},\"thunderclap\":{\"name\":\"Thunderclap\",\"effect\":\"This move enables the user to attack first with a jolt of electricity. This move fails if the target is not readying an attack.\"},\"mightyCleave\":{\"name\":\"Mighty Cleave\",\"effect\":\"The user wields the light that has accumulated through its blades to cleave the target. This move hits even if the target protects itself.\"},\"tachyonCutter\":{\"name\":\"Tachyon Cutter\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by launching particle blades at the target twice in a row. This attack never misses.\"},\"hardPress\":{\"name\":\"Hard Press\",\"effect\":\"The target is crushed with an arm, a claw, or the like to inflict damage. The more HP the target has left, the greater the move\u2019s power (ranging between 1 and 100).\"},\"dragonCheer\":{\"name\":\"Dragon Cheer\",\"effect\":\"The user raises its allies\u2019 morale with a draconic cry so that their future attacks have a heightened chance of landing critical hits. Dragon types receive a 2-stage boost. All other types receive a 1-stage boost.\"},\"alluringVoice\":{\"name\":\"Alluring Voice\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target using its angelic voice. This also confuses the target if its stats have been boosted during the turn.\"},\"temperFlare\":{\"name\":\"Temper Flare\",\"effect\":\"Spurred by desperation, the user attacks the target. This move\u2019s power is doubled if the user\u2019s previous move failed.\"},\"supercellSlam\":{\"name\":\"Supercell Slam\",\"effect\":\"The user electrifies its body and drops onto the target to inflict damage. The user takes damage equal to \u00bd of its max HP if this move misses or fails. If the target has used Minimize, this move\u2019s power is doubled and it will be sure to hit.\"},\"psychicNoise\":{\"name\":\"Psychic Noise\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks the target with unpleasant sound waves. For 2 turns, the target is prevented from recovering HP through moves, Abilities, or held items.\"},\"upperHand\":{\"name\":\"Upper Hand\",\"effect\":\"The user reacts to the target\u2019s movement and strikes with the heel of its palm, making the target flinch. This move fails if the target is not readying a priority move.\"},\"malignantChain\":{\"name\":\"Malignant Chain\",\"effect\":\"The user pours toxins into the target by wrapping them in a toxic, corrosive chain. This move has a 50% chance of badly poisoning the target.\"},\"nihilLight\":{\"name\":\"Nihil Light\",\"effect\":\"The user attacks by unleashing a powerful light that defies all laws of nature, striking even Fairy types and ignoring any stat changes affecting its targets.\"}}"},
{"ability","{\"stench\":{\"name\":\"Stench\",\"description\":\"By releasing a stench when attacking, there is a 10% chance that targets damaged by the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves will flinch. This does not stack with moves or items that have a chance to flinch.\"},\"drizzle\":{\"name\":\"Drizzle\",\"description\":\"Summons rain for 5 turns when the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle. Powers up Water-type moves by 50% and halves the damage of Fire-type moves.\"},\"speedBoost\":{\"name\":\"Speed Boost\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Speed stat at the end of every turn.\"},\"battleArmor\":{\"name\":\"Battle Armor\",\"description\":\"Hard armor protects the Pok\u00e9mon from critical hits.\"},\"sturdy\":{\"name\":\"Sturdy\",\"description\":\"If the Pok\u00e9mon has full HP and takes damage from a move that would knock it out in one hit, it will endure the hit with 1 HP. The Pok\u00e9mon is also immune to one-hit KO moves.\"},\"damp\":{\"name\":\"Damp\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon dampens its surroundings, preventing all Pok\u00e9mon from using explosive moves such as Self-Destruct or dealing damage with Aftermath.\"},\"limber\":{\"name\":\"Limber\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s limber body prevents it from being paralyzed.\"},\"sandVeil\":{\"name\":\"Sand Veil\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s evasiveness by 25% in a sandstorm. The Pok\u00e9mon also takes no damage from sandstorms.\"},\"static\":{\"name\":\"Static\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon is charged with static electricity and has a 30% chance to paralyze attackers that hit it with a contact move.\"},\"voltAbsorb\":{\"name\":\"Volt Absorb\",\"description\":\"Electric-type moves do not work on the Pok\u00e9mon. Instead, they restore \u00bc of its max HP.\"},\"waterAbsorb\":{\"name\":\"Water Absorb\",\"description\":\"Water-type moves do not work on the Pok\u00e9mon. Instead, they restore \u00bc of its max HP.\"},\"oblivious\":{\"name\":\"Oblivious\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon is oblivious, keeping it from being infatuated, falling for taunts, or being affected by Intimidate.\"},\"cloudNine\":{\"name\":\"Cloud Nine\",\"description\":\"Eliminates the effects of weather.\"},\"compoundEyes\":{\"name\":\"Compound Eyes\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s compound eyes boost its accuracy by 30%.\"},\"insomnia\":{\"name\":\"Insomnia\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s insomnia prevents it from becoming drowsy or being put to sleep.\"},\"colorChange\":{\"name\":\"Color Change\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s type becomes the type of the move used on it.\"},\"immunity\":{\"name\":\"Immunity\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s immune system prevents it from being poisoned or badly poisoned.\"},\"flashFire\":{\"name\":\"Flash Fire\",\"description\":\"If hit by a Fire-type move, the Pok\u00e9mon absorbs the flames and uses them to power up its own Fire-type moves by 50%.\"},\"shieldDust\":{\"name\":\"Shield Dust\",\"description\":\"Protective dust shields the Pok\u00e9mon from the additional effects of moves.\"},\"ownTempo\":{\"name\":\"Own Tempo\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon sticks to its own tempo, preventing it from becoming confused. It is also unaffected by Intimidate.\"},\"suctionCups\":{\"name\":\"Suction Cups\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon uses suction cups to stay in one spot. This protects it from moves and items that would force it to switch out.\"},\"intimidate\":{\"name\":\"Intimidate\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pok\u00e9mon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats.\"},\"shadowTag\":{\"name\":\"Shadow Tag\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon steps on the opposing Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s shadows to prevent them from fleeing or switching out.\"},\"roughSkin\":{\"name\":\"Rough Skin\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s rough skin damages attackers that hit it with contact moves for \u215b of their max HP.\"},\"wonderGuard\":{\"name\":\"Wonder Guard\",\"description\":\"Its mysterious power only lets super effective moves hit the Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"levitate\":{\"name\":\"Levitate\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon floats off the ground, making it immune to Ground-type moves, as well as Spikes, Toxic Spikes, and Sticky Web.\"},\"effectSpore\":{\"name\":\"Effect Spore\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a contact move, the attacker has a 30% chance of being poisoned, paralyzed, or put to sleep. Grass-type Pok\u00e9mon are unaffected.\"},\"synchronize\":{\"name\":\"Synchronize\",\"description\":\"If the Pok\u00e9mon is burned, paralyzed, poisoned, or badly poisoned by another Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s move or Ability, that Pok\u00e9mon will also be inflicted with the same status condition. If this Pok\u00e9mon is your lead into battle, opposing wild Pok\u00e9mon will share its nature.\"},\"clearBody\":{\"name\":\"Clear Body\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s stats cannot be lowered by other Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves or Abilities.\"},\"naturalCure\":{\"name\":\"Natural Cure\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s status conditions are cured when it switches out of battle.\"},\"lightningRod\":{\"name\":\"Lightning Rod\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon draws in all Electric-type moves. These moves do not work on the Pok\u00e9mon. Instead, they boost its Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"sereneGrace\":{\"name\":\"Serene Grace\",\"description\":\"Doubles the likelihood of additional effects occurring when the Pok\u00e9mon uses its moves. This does not affect items.\"},\"swiftSwim\":{\"name\":\"Swift Swim\",\"description\":\"Doubles the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Speed stat in rain.\"},\"chlorophyll\":{\"name\":\"Chlorophyll\",\"description\":\"Doubles the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Speed stat in harsh sunlight.\"},\"illuminate\":{\"name\":\"Illuminate\",\"description\":\"By illuminating its surroundings, the Pok\u00e9mon prevents its accuracy from being lowered and ignores changes to targets\u2019 evasiveness. Raises the likelihood of Double Battles while this Pok\u00e9mon is on the field.\"},\"trace\":{\"name\":\"Trace\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle, it changes its Ability to match that of an opponent.\"},\"hugePower\":{\"name\":\"Huge Power\",\"description\":\"Doubles the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s physical moves.\"},\"poisonPoint\":{\"name\":\"Poison Point\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a contact move, the attacker has a 30% chance of being poisoned.\"},\"innerFocus\":{\"name\":\"Inner Focus\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s intense focus prevents it from flinching or being affected by Intimidate.\"},\"magmaArmor\":{\"name\":\"Magma Armor\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s hot magma coating prevents it from being frozen.\"},\"waterVeil\":{\"name\":\"Water Veil\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s water veil prevents it from being burned.\"},\"magnetPull\":{\"name\":\"Magnet Pull\",\"description\":\"Prevents Steel-type Pok\u00e9mon from fleeing by pulling them in with magnetism.\"},\"soundproof\":{\"name\":\"Soundproof\",\"description\":\"Soundproofing gives the Pok\u00e9mon full immunity to all sound-based moves.\"},\"rainDish\":{\"name\":\"Rain Dish\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon has \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of its max HP restored at the end of every turn in rain.\"},\"sandStream\":{\"name\":\"Sand Stream\",\"description\":\"Summons a sandstorm for 5 turns when the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle. Pok\u00e9mon that are not Rock, Ground, or Steel types take damage equal to \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of their max HP at the end of every turn. This also boosts the Sp. Def stats of Rock types by 50%.\"},\"pressure\":{\"name\":\"Pressure\",\"description\":\"Puts opposing Pok\u00e9mon under pressure, causing them to expend 1 more PP when using moves against the Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"thickFat\":{\"name\":\"Thick Fat\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon is protected by a layer of thick fat, which halves the damage taken from Fire- and Ice-type moves.\"},\"earlyBird\":{\"name\":\"Early Bird\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon awakens from sleep twice as fast as other Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"flameBody\":{\"name\":\"Flame Body\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a contact move, the attacker has a 30% chance of being burned.\"},\"runAway\":{\"name\":\"Run Away\",\"description\":\"Enables a sure getaway from wild Pok\u00e9mon, as well as ignoring any effect that would usually prevent the Pok\u00e9mon from switching out.\"},\"keenEye\":{\"name\":\"Keen Eye\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s keen eyes prevent its accuracy from being lowered and ignore changes to targets\u2019 evasiveness.\"},\"hyperCutter\":{\"name\":\"Hyper Cutter\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s prized, mighty pincers prevent other Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves or Abilities from lowering its Attack stat.\"},\"pickup\":{\"name\":\"Pickup\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon may pick up an item another Pok\u00e9mon used during a battle, even if it did not participate.\"},\"truant\":{\"name\":\"Truant\",\"description\":\"Each time the Pok\u00e9mon uses a move, it spends the next turn loafing around.\"},\"hustle\":{\"name\":\"Hustle\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon uses physical moves, its Attack stat is boosted by 50%, but its accuracy is lowered by 20%.\"},\"cuteCharm\":{\"name\":\"Cute Charm\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a contact move, the attacker has a 30% chance of becoming infatuated if the attacker and the Pok\u00e9mon are of opposite genders.\"},\"plus\":{\"name\":\"Plus\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Sp. Atk stat is boosted by 50% if an ally with the Plus or Minus Ability is also in battle.\"},\"minus\":{\"name\":\"Minus\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Sp. Atk stat is boosted by 50% if an ally with the Plus or Minus Ability is also in battle.\"},\"forecast\":{\"name\":\"Forecast\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon transforms with the weather to change its type to Water, Fire, or Ice.\"},\"stickyHold\":{\"name\":\"Sticky Hold\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s held items cling to its sticky body and cannot be stolen or removed by other Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"shedSkin\":{\"name\":\"Shed Skin\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon has a 30% chance of curing its own status conditions at the end of every turn by shedding its skin.\"},\"guts\":{\"name\":\"Guts\",\"description\":\"It\u2019s so gutsy that having a status condition boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Attack stat by 50%. Being burned does not halve the damage dealt by the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s physical moves.\"},\"marvelScale\":{\"name\":\"Marvel Scale\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s marvelous scales boost its Defense stat by 50% if it has a status condition.\"},\"liquidOoze\":{\"name\":\"Liquid Ooze\",\"description\":\"The strong stench of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s oozed liquid damages attackers that use HP-draining moves instead of healing them.\"},\"overgrow\":{\"name\":\"Overgrow\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Grass-type moves by 50% when its HP drops to \u2153 or less of its max.\"},\"blaze\":{\"name\":\"Blaze\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Fire-type moves by 50% when its HP drops to \u2153 or less of its max.\"},\"torrent\":{\"name\":\"Torrent\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Water-type moves by 50% when its HP drops to \u2153 or less of its max.\"},\"swarm\":{\"name\":\"Swarm\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Bug-type moves by 50% when its HP drops to \u2153 or less of its max.\"},\"rockHead\":{\"name\":\"Rock Head\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon will not lose HP due to recoil damage from its moves.\"},\"drought\":{\"name\":\"Drought\",\"description\":\"Summons harsh sunlight for 5 turns when the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle. Powers up Fire-type moves by 50% and halves the damage of Water-type moves.\"},\"arenaTrap\":{\"name\":\"Arena Trap\",\"description\":\"Prevents opposing Pok\u00e9mon from fleeing or switching out. Raises the likelihood of Double Battles while this Pok\u00e9mon is on the field.\"},\"vitalSpirit\":{\"name\":\"Vital Spirit\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon is full of vitality, and that prevents it from becoming drowsy or being put to sleep.\"},\"whiteSmoke\":{\"name\":\"White Smoke\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon is protected by its white smoke, which prevents its stats from being lowered by other Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves or Abilities.\"},\"purePower\":{\"name\":\"Pure Power\",\"description\":\"Using its pure power, the Pok\u00e9mon doubles the power of its physical moves.\"},\"shellArmor\":{\"name\":\"Shell Armor\",\"description\":\"A hard shell protects the Pok\u00e9mon from critical hits.\"},\"airLock\":{\"name\":\"Air Lock\",\"description\":\"Eliminates the effects of weather.\"},\"tangledFeet\":{\"name\":\"Tangled Feet\",\"description\":\"Doubles the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s evasiveness if it is confused.\"},\"motorDrive\":{\"name\":\"Motor Drive\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon takes no damage when hit by Electric-type moves. Instead, its Speed stat is boosted.\"},\"rivalry\":{\"name\":\"Rivalry\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s competitive spirit boosts the power of its moves by 25% against targets of the same gender, and lowers it by 25% against targets of the opposite gender. The power remains the same as usual if either Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s gender is unknown.\"},\"steadfast\":{\"name\":\"Steadfast\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s determination boosts its Speed stat when it flinches.\"},\"snowCloak\":{\"name\":\"Snow Cloak\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s evasiveness by 25% in snow or hail. The Pok\u00e9mon also takes no damage from hail.\"},\"gluttony\":{\"name\":\"Gluttony\",\"description\":\"If the Pok\u00e9mon is holding