at boosted by 50%.\"},\"honeyGather\":{\"name\":\"Honey Gather\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon gathers Honey which is then sold for money after a battle is won, even if it did not participate.\"},\"frisk\":{\"name\":\"Frisk\",\"description\":\"When it enters a battle, the Pok\u00e9mon can check an opposing Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Ability.\"},\"reckless\":{\"name\":\"Reckless\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves by 20% if they have recoil or crash damage.\"},\"multitype\":{\"name\":\"Multitype\",\"description\":\"Changes the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s type to match the Plate it holds.\"},\"flowerGift\":{\"name\":\"Flower Gift\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Attack and Sp. Def stats of the Pok\u00e9mon and its allies by 50% in harsh sunlight.\"},\"badDreams\":{\"name\":\"Bad Dreams\",\"description\":\"Damages opposing Pok\u00e9mon that are asleep at the end of every turn by \u215b of their max HP.\"},\"pickpocket\":{\"name\":\"Pickpocket\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a contact move, it will steal a held item from the attacker.\"},\"sheerForce\":{\"name\":\"Sheer Force\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves lose their additional effects, but the power of those moves will be boosted by 30%.\"},\"contrary\":{\"name\":\"Contrary\",\"description\":\"Reverses any stat changes affecting the Pok\u00e9mon so that attempts to boost its stats instead lower them \u2014 and attempts to lower its stats will boost them.\"},\"unnerve\":{\"name\":\"Unnerve\",\"description\":\"Unnerves opposing Pok\u00e9mon and makes them unable to eat Berries.\"},\"defiant\":{\"name\":\"Defiant\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon has any of its stats lowered by an opponent, its Attack stat is boosted sharply.\"},\"defeatist\":{\"name\":\"Defeatist\",\"description\":\"Halves the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Attack and Sp. Atk stats when its HP drops to \u00bd or less.\"},\"cursedBody\":{\"name\":\"Cursed Body\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon takes damage from a move, the attacker has a 30% chance to have whichever move it last used disabled for 4 turns.\"},\"healer\":{\"name\":\"Healer\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon has a 50% chance of curing the status conditions of its allies at the end of every turn.\"},\"friendGuard\":{\"name\":\"Friend Guard\",\"description\":\"Reduces the damage allies take by 25%.\"},\"weakArmor\":{\"name\":\"Weak Armor\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon takes damage from a physical move, its Defense stat is lowered, but its Speed stat is boosted sharply.\"},\"heavyMetal\":{\"name\":\"Heavy Metal\",\"description\":\"Doubles the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s weight.\"},\"lightMetal\":{\"name\":\"Light Metal\",\"description\":\"Halves the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s weight.\"},\"multiscale\":{\"name\":\"Multiscale\",\"description\":\"Halves the damage the Pok\u00e9mon takes while its HP is full.\"},\"toxicBoost\":{\"name\":\"Toxic Boost\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is poisoned or badly poisoned, the power of its physical moves is boosted by 50%.\"},\"flareBoost\":{\"name\":\"Flare Boost\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is burned, the power of its special moves is boosted by 50%.\"},\"harvest\":{\"name\":\"Harvest\",\"description\":\"If the Pok\u00e9mon has used a Berry, it has a 50% chance of creating another one at the end of every turn. In harsh sunlight, the Pok\u00e9mon is guaranteed to create a Berry.\"},\"telepathy\":{\"name\":\"Telepathy\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon anticipates and dodges the attacks of its allies.\"},\"moody\":{\"name\":\"Moody\",\"description\":\"At the end of every turn, one of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s stats will be boosted sharply, but another will be lowered. Accuracy and evasiveness are excluded.\"},\"overcoat\":{\"name\":\"Overcoat\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon takes no damage from sandstorms or hail, and is immune to moves and Abilities involving powder or spores.\"},\"poisonTouch\":{\"name\":\"Poison Touch\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon hits a target with a contact move, the target has a 30% chance of being poisoned.\"},\"regenerator\":{\"name\":\"Regenerator\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon has \u2153 of its max HP restored when it switches out of battle.\"},\"bigPecks\":{\"name\":\"Big Pecks\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Defense stat cannot be lowered by other Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves or Abilities.\"},\"sandRush\":{\"name\":\"Sand Rush\",\"description\":\"Doubles the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Speed stat in a sandstorm. The Pok\u00e9mon also takes no damage from sandstorms.\"},\"wonderSkin\":{\"name\":\"Wonder Skin\",\"description\":\"Lowers the accuracy of status moves used against the Pok\u00e9mon to 50%.\"},\"analytic\":{\"name\":\"Analytic\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s move by 30% when the Pok\u00e9mon is the last to move that turn.\"},\"illusion\":{\"name\":\"Illusion\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon fools opponents by entering battle disguised as the last Pok\u00e9mon in its party. It reverts to its usual appearance when it takes damage from a move.\"},\"imposter\":{\"name\":\"Imposter\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon transforms into the Pok\u00e9mon in front of it. It also copies all of that Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s stats apart from its HP. Copied moves have 5 PP each.\"},\"infiltrator\":{\"name\":\"Infiltrator\",\"description\":\"When using its moves, the Pok\u00e9mon ignores the effects of targets\u2019 Light Screen, Reflect, Aurora Veil, Safeguard, and substitutes.\"},\"mummy\":{\"name\":\"Mummy\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a contact move, the attacker has its Ability changed to Mummy.\"},\"moxie\":{\"name\":\"Moxie\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon knocks out a target with an attack, it shows moxie, which boosts its Attack stat.\"},\"justified\":{\"name\":\"Justified\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a Dark-type move, its Attack stat is boosted by its sense of justice.\"},\"rattled\":{\"name\":\"Rattled\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon gets scared when hit by a Dark-, Ghost-, or Bug-type attack or if intimidated, which boosts its Speed stat.\"},\"magicBounce\":{\"name\":\"Magic Bounce\",\"description\":\"Instead of being affected by other Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s status moves, the Pok\u00e9mon bounces them back at the user.\"},\"sapSipper\":{\"name\":\"Sap Sipper\",\"description\":\"Grass-type moves do not work on the Pok\u00e9mon. Instead, they boost its Attack stat.\"},\"prankster\":{\"name\":\"Prankster\",\"description\":\"Increases the priority of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s status moves by 1 stage. However, the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s status moves no longer work against Dark-type Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"sandForce\":{\"name\":\"Sand Force\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Rock-, Ground-, and Steel-type moves by 30% in a sandstorm. The Pok\u00e9mon also takes no damage from sandstorms.\"},\"ironBarbs\":{\"name\":\"Iron Barbs\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s iron barbs damage attackers that hit it with contact moves for \u215b of their max HP.\"},\"zenMode\":{\"name\":\"Zen Mode\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon changes its form to Zen Mode when its HP drops to \u00bd or less.\"},\"victoryStar\":{\"name\":\"Victory Star\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon and its allies have their accuracy boosted by 10%.\"},\"turboblaze\":{\"name\":\"Turboblaze\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves are unaffected by the Ability of the target, with certain exceptions.\"},\"teravolt\":{\"name\":\"Teravolt\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves are unaffected by the Ability of the target, with certain exceptions.\"},\"aromaVeil\":{\"name\":\"Aroma Veil\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon and its allies are protected from Infatuation, Taunt, Torment, Disable, Heal Block, and Encore.\"},\"flowerVeil\":{\"name\":\"Flower Veil\",\"description\":\"If the Pok\u00e9mon or its allies are Grass-type, they are immune to status conditions and cannot have their stats lowered.\"},\"cheekPouch\":{\"name\":\"Cheek Pouch\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon has \u2153 of its max HP restored when it eats a Berry, in addition to the Berry\u2019s usual effect.\"},\"protean\":{\"name\":\"Protean\",\"description\":\"Changes the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s type to the type of the move it\u2019s about to use.\"},\"furCoat\":{\"name\":\"Fur Coat\",\"description\":\"Halves the damage the Pok\u00e9mon takes from physical moves.\"},\"magician\":{\"name\":\"Magician\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon steals the held item from any target it hits with a move.\"},\"bulletproof\":{\"name\":\"Bulletproof\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon is immune to ball and bomb moves.\"},\"competitive\":{\"name\":\"Competitive\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon has any of its stats lowered by an opponent, its Sp. Atk stat is boosted sharply.\"},\"strongJaw\":{\"name\":\"Strong Jaw\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s strong jaw boosts the power of its biting moves by 50%.\"},\"refrigerate\":{\"name\":\"Refrigerate\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Normal-type moves become Ice-type moves and their power is boosted by 20%.\"},\"sweetVeil\":{\"name\":\"Sweet Veil\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon and its allies cannot become drowsy or be put to sleep.\"},\"stanceChange\":{\"name\":\"Stance Change\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon changes into its Blade Forme when it attacks and changes into its Shield Forme when it uses the move King\u2019s Shield.\"},\"galeWings\":{\"name\":\"Gale Wings\",\"description\":\"Increases the priority of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Flying-type moves by 1 stage while its HP is full.\"},\"megaLauncher\":{\"name\":\"Mega Launcher\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of Aura Sphere and moves with \u201cPulse\u201d in their names by 50%.\"},\"grassPelt\":{\"name\":\"Grass Pelt\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Defense stat by 50% on Grassy Terrain.\"},\"symbiosis\":{\"name\":\"Symbiosis\",\"description\":\"When an ally consumes an item, the Pok\u00e9mon gives its own held item to that ally.\"},\"toughClaws\":{\"name\":\"Tough Claws\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s contact moves by 30%.\"},\"pixilate\":{\"name\":\"Pixilate\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Normal-type moves become Fairy-type moves and their power is boosted by 20%.\"},\"gooey\":{\"name\":\"Gooey\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a contact move, the attacker\u2019s Speed stat is lowered.\"},\"aerilate\":{\"name\":\"Aerilate\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Normal-type moves become Flying-type moves and their power is boosted by 20%.\"},\"parentalBond\":{\"name\":\"Parental Bond\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon attacks, its kin follows up with a second strike at \u00bc of the first attack\u2019s power. This does not occur for multistrike moves or moves that target multiple Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"darkAura\":{\"name\":\"Dark Aura\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Dark-type moves of all Pok\u00e9mon on the field by 33%.\"},\"fairyAura\":{\"name\":\"Fairy Aura\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Fairy-type moves of all Pok\u00e9mon on the field by 33%.\"},\"auraBreak\":{\"name\":\"Aura Break\",\"description\":\"The effects of Fairy Aura and Dark Aura are reversed and nullified, causing affected moves to be 25% weaker.\"},\"primordialSea\":{\"name\":\"Primordial Sea\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon changes the weather to nullify Fire-type attacks and increase the damage of Water-type moves by 50%.\"},\"desolateLand\":{\"name\":\"Desolate Land\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon changes the weather to nullify Water-type attacks and increase the damage of Fire-type moves by 50%.\"},\"deltaStream\":{\"name\":\"Delta Stream\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon changes the weather so that no moves are super effective against the Flying type.\"},\"stamina\":{\"name\":\"Stamina\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon takes damage from a move, its Defense stat is boosted.\"},\"wimpOut\":{\"name\":\"Wimp Out\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon cowardly switches out when its HP drops to \u00bd or less.\"},\"emergencyExit\":{\"name\":\"Emergency Exit\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon, sensing danger, switches out when its HP drops to \u00bd or less.\"},\"waterCompaction\":{\"name\":\"Water Compaction\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Defense stat sharply when the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a Water-type move.\"},\"merciless\":{\"name\":\"Merciless\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s attacks become critical hits if the target is poisoned.\"},\"shieldsDown\":{\"name\":\"Shields Down\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s shell protects it from status conditions. When its HP drops to \u00bd or less, the shell breaks and it becomes aggressive, changing into its Core Form.\"},\"stakeout\":{\"name\":\"Stakeout\",\"description\":\"Doubles the damage dealt to a target that has just switched into battle.\"},\"waterBubble\":{\"name\":\"Water Bubble\",\"description\":\"Halves the damage the Pok\u00e9mon takes from Fire-type moves and doubles the power of its Water-type moves. The Pok\u00e9mon cannot be burned.\"},\"steelworker\":{\"name\":\"Steelworker\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Steel-type moves by 50%.\"},\"berserk\":{\"name\":\"Berserk\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Sp. Atk stat when an attack causes its HP to drop to \u00bd or less of its max.\"},\"slushRush\":{\"name\":\"Slush Rush\",\"description\":\"Doubles the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Speed stat in snow or hail. The Pok\u00e9mon also takes no damage from hail.\"},\"longReach\":{\"name\":\"Long Reach\",\"description\":\"None of the moves used by the Pok\u00e9mon are considered contact moves.\"},\"liquidVoice\":{\"name\":\"Liquid Voice\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s sound-based moves become Water-type moves.\"},\"triage\":{\"name\":\"Triage\",\"description\":\"Increases the priority of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s healing moves by 3 stages.\"},\"galvanize\":{\"name\":\"Galvanize\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Normal-type moves become Electric-type moves and their power is boosted by 20%.\"},\"surgeSurfer\":{\"name\":\"Surge Surfer\",\"description\":\"Doubles the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Speed stat on Electric Terrain.\"},\"schooling\":{\"name\":\"Schooling\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon forms a powerful school when it reaches level 20. It stops schooling when its HP drops to \u00bc or less.\"},\"disguise\":{\"name\":\"Disguise\",\"description\":\"Once per battle, the shroud that covers the Pok\u00e9mon can protect it from an attack at the cost of losing \u215b of its max HP.\"},\"battleBond\":{\"name\":\"Battle Bond\",\"description\":\"Once per switch-in when the Pok\u00e9mon knocks out a target, its Attack, Sp. Atk, and Speed stats are boosted. If a Greninja has this ability, it instead transforms into Ash-Greninja whenever it knocks out a target.\"},\"powerConstruct\":{\"name\":\"Power Construct\",\"description\":\"Cells gather to aid the Pok\u00e9mon when its HP drops to \u00bd or less, causing it to change into its Complete Forme.\"},\"corrosion\":{\"name\":\"Corrosion\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon can poison or badly poison targets even if they\u2019re Steel or Poison types.\"},\"comatose\":{\"name\":\"Comatose\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon is always drowsing and can attack while in its sleeping state. It is considered under the effects of a status condition.\"},\"queenlyMajesty\":{\"name\":\"Queenly Majesty\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s majesty pressures opponents and makes them unable to use priority moves against the Pok\u00e9mon or its allies.\"},\"innardsOut\":{\"name\":\"Innards Out\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon takes damage from a move that knocks it out, it deals the same amount of damage to the attacker.\"},\"dancer\":{\"name\":\"Dancer\",\"description\":\"Whenever a dance move is used in battle, the Pok\u00e9mon will copy the user to immediately perform that dance move itself.\"},\"battery\":{\"name\":\"Battery\",\"description\":\"Powers up special moves used by allies by 30%.\"},\"fluffy\":{\"name\":\"Fluffy\",\"description\":\"Halves the damage taken from moves that make direct contact, but doubles that of Fire-type moves.\"},\"dazzling\":{\"name\":\"Dazzling\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon dazzles its opponents, making them unable to use priority moves against the Pok\u00e9mon or its allies.\"},\"soulHeart\":{\"name\":\"Soul-Heart\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Sp. Atk stat every time another Pok\u00e9mon faints.\"},\"tanglingHair\":{\"name\":\"Tangling Hair\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a contact move, the attacker\u2019s Speed stat is lowered.\"},\"receiver\":{\"name\":\"Receiver\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon changes its Ability to match that of a defeated ally in a Double Battle.\"},\"powerOfAlchemy\":{\"name\":\"Power of Alchemy\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon changes its Ability to match that of a defeated ally in a Double Battle.\"},\"beastBoost\":{\"name\":\"Beast Boost\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s most proficient stat every time it knocks out a target.\"},\"rksSystem\":{\"name\":\"RKS System\",\"description\":\"Changes the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s type to match the memory disc it holds.\"},\"electricSurge\":{\"name\":\"Electric Surge\",\"description\":\"Turns the ground into Electric Terrain for 5 turns when the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle. Pok\u00e9mon on the ground have their Electric-type moves boosted by 30% and cannot be put to sleep.\"},\"psychicSurge\":{\"name\":\"Psychic Surge\",\"description\":\"Turns the ground into Psychic Terrain for 5 turns when the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle. Pok\u00e9mon on the ground have their Psychic-type moves boosted by 30% and cannot use or be targeted by moves with increased priority.\"},\"mistySurge\":{\"name\":\"Misty Surge\",\"description\":\"Turns the ground into Misty Terrain for 5 turns when the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle. Pok\u00e9mon on the ground are protected from status conditions and receive half the damage dealt by Dragon-type moves.\"},\"grassySurge\":{\"name\":\"Grassy Surge\",\"description\":\"Turns the ground into Grassy Terrain for 5 turns when the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle. Pok\u00e9mon on the ground have their Grass-type moves boosted by 30% and restore \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of their max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"fullMetalBody\":{\"name\":\"Full Metal Body\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s stats cannot be lowered by other Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves or Abilities. This effect cannot be ignored.\"},\"shadowShield\":{\"name\":\"Shadow Shield\",\"description\":\"Halves the damage the Pok\u00e9mon takes while its HP is full. This effect cannot be ignored by other Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves or Abilities.\"},\"prismArmor\":{\"name\":\"Prism Armor\",\"description\":\"Reduces the damage the Pok\u00e9mon takes from super effective moves by 25%. This effect cannot be ignored by other Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves or Abilities.\"},\"neuroforce\":{\"name\":\"Neuroforce\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves that are super effective against the target by 25%.\"},\"intrepidSword\":{\"name\":\"Intrepid Sword\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Attack stat when the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle.\"},\"dauntlessShield\":{\"name\":\"Dauntless Shield\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Defense stat when the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle.\"},\"libero\":{\"name\":\"Libero\",\"description\":\"Changes the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s type to the type of the move it\u2019s about to use.\"},\"ballFetch\":{\"name\":\"Ball Fetch\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon will fetch the Pok\u00e9 Ball from the first failed throw of the battle, even if it did not participate.\"},\"cottonDown\":{\"name\":\"Cotton Down\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by an attack, it scatters cotton fluff around and lowers the Speed stat of all Pok\u00e9mon except itself.\"},\"propellerTail\":{\"name\":\"Propeller Tail\",\"description\":\"Ignores the effects of opposing Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Abilities and moves that draw in moves.\"},\"mirrorArmor\":{\"name\":\"Mirror Armor\",\"description\":\"Instead of being affected by stat-lowering effects, the Pok\u00e9mon bounces them back at whichever Pok\u00e9mon caused them.\"},\"gulpMissile\":{\"name\":\"Gulp Missile\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon uses Surf or Dive, it returns with prey. If the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a move, it spits out its prey at the attacker, dealing damage equal to \u00bc of the attacker\u2019s max HP. This also lowers the attacker\u2019s Defense stat or paralyzes it, depending on the caught prey.\"},\"stalwart\":{\"name\":\"Stalwart\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon ignores the effects of Abilities and moves that draw in moves.\"},\"steamEngine\":{\"name\":\"Steam Engine\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Speed stat by 6 stages when the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a Fire- or Water-type move.\"},\"punkRock\":{\"name\":\"Punk Rock\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s sound-based moves by 30% and halves the damage the Pok\u00e9mon takes from sound-based moves.\"},\"sandSpit\":{\"name\":\"Sand Spit\",\"description\":\"Summons a sandstorm for 5 turns when the Pok\u00e9mon takes damage from moves. Pok\u00e9mon that are not Rock, Ground, or Steel types take damage equal to \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of their max HP at the end of every turn. This also boosts the Sp. Def stats of Rock types by 50%.\"},\"iceScales\":{\"name\":\"Ice Scales\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon is protected by ice scales, which halve the damage taken from special moves.\"},\"ripen\":{\"name\":\"Ripen\",\"description\":\"Ripens and doubles the effect of berries eaten by the Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"iceFace\":{\"name\":\"Ice Face\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s ice head can take a physical attack as a substitute, the ice will be restored when it begins to snow or hail.\"},\"powerSpot\":{\"name\":\"Power Spot\",\"description\":\"Just being next to the Pok\u00e9mon powers up the moves of its allies by 30%.\"},\"mimicry\":{\"name\":\"Mimicry\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s type changes depending on the terrain.\"},\"screenCleaner\":{\"name\":\"Screen Cleaner\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle, the effects of Light Screen, Reflect, and Aurora Veil are nullified for both opposing and ally Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"steelySpirit\":{\"name\":\"Steely Spirit\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of Steel-type moves used by the Pok\u00e9mon and its allies by 50%.\"},\"perishBody\":{\"name\":\"Perish Body\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a contact move, the Pok\u00e9mon and the attacker will faint after three turns unless they switch out of battle. Boss Pok\u00e9mon are immune to this effect.\"},\"wanderingSpirit\":{\"name\":\"Wandering Spirit\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a contact move, it swaps Abilities with the attacker.\"},\"gorillaTactics\":{\"name\":\"Gorilla Tactics\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Attack stat by 50%, but only allows the use of the first selected move.\"},\"neutralizingGas\":{\"name\":\"Neutralizing Gas\",\"description\":\"While the Pok\u00e9mon is in the battle, the effects of all other Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Abilities and Passives will be nullified or will not be triggered.\"},\"pastelVeil\":{\"name\":\"Pastel Veil\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon and its allies are protected from being poisoned or badly poisoned.\"},\"hungerSwitch\":{\"name\":\"Hunger Switch\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon changes its form, alternating between its Full Belly Mode and Hangry Mode after the end of every turn.\"},\"quickDraw\":{\"name\":\"Quick Draw\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves have a 30% chance of going first among moves of the same priority.\"},\"unseenFist\":{\"name\":\"Unseen Fist\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon uses contact moves, it can hit even targets that are protecting themselves, dealing \u00bc of the damage that the move would otherwise deal. Everything aside from the target\u2019s protective effects is still triggered.\"},\"curiousMedicine\":{\"name\":\"Curious Medicine\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle, it scatters medicine from its shell, which removes all stat changes from allies.\"},\"transistor\":{\"name\":\"Transistor\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Electric-type moves by 30%.\"},\"dragonsMaw\":{\"name\":\"Dragon\u2019s Maw\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Dragon-type moves by 50%.\"},\"chillingNeigh\":{\"name\":\"Chilling Neigh\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon knocks out a target, it utters a chilling neigh, which boosts its Attack stat.\"},\"grimNeigh\":{\"name\":\"Grim Neigh\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon knocks out a target, it utters a terrifying neigh, which boosts its Sp. Atk stat.\"},\"asOneGlastrier\":{\"name\":\"As One\",\"description\":\"This Ability combines the effects of both Unnerve and Chilling Neigh, preventing opposing Pok\u00e9mon from consuming berries and boosting the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Attack stat when knocking out a target.\"},\"asOneSpectrier\":{\"name\":\"As One\",\"description\":\"This Ability combines the effects of both Unnerve and Grim Neigh, preventing opposing Pok\u00e9mon from consuming berries and boosting the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Sp. Atk stat when knocking out a target.\"},\"lingeringAroma\":{\"name\":\"Lingering Aroma\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a contact move, the attacker has its Ability changed to Lingering Aroma.\"},\"seedSower\":{\"name\":\"Seed Sower\",\"description\":\"Turns the ground into Grassy Terrain for 5 turns when the Pok\u00e9mon takes damage from moves. Pok\u00e9mon on the ground have their Grass-type moves boosted by 30% and restore \u00b9\u2044\u2081\u2086 of their max HP at the end of every turn.\"},\"thermalExchange\":{\"name\":\"Thermal Exchange\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Attack stat when the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a Fire-type move. The Pok\u00e9mon also cannot be burned.\"},\"angerShell\":{\"name\":\"Anger Shell\",\"description\":\"When an attack causes its HP to drop to \u00bd or less, the Pok\u00e9mon gets angry. This lowers its Defense and Sp. Def stats but boosts its Attack, Sp. Atk, and Speed stats.\"},\"purifyingSalt\":{\"name\":\"Purifying Salt\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s pure salt protects it from status conditions and halves the damage taken from Ghost-type moves.\"},\"wellBakedBody\":{\"name\":\"Well-Baked Body\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon takes no damage when hit by Fire-type moves. Instead, its Defense stat is sharply boosted.\"},\"windRider\":{\"name\":\"Wind Rider\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Attack stat if Tailwind takes effect or if the Pok\u00e9mon is hit by a wind move. The Pok\u00e9mon also takes no damage from wind moves.\"},\"guardDog\":{\"name\":\"Guard Dog\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Attack stat if intimidated. Moves and items that would force the Pok\u00e9mon to switch out also fail to work.\"},\"rockyPayload\":{\"name\":\"Rocky Payload\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Rock-type moves by 50%.\"},\"windPower\":{\"name\":\"Wind Power\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon becomes charged when Tailwind takes effect or it is hit by a wind move, boosting the power of the next Electric-type move the Pok\u00e9mon uses.\"},\"zeroToHero\":{\"name\":\"Zero to Hero\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon transforms into its Hero Form when it switches out of battle.\"},\"commander\":{\"name\":\"Commander\",\"description\":\"Upon entering battle, the Pok\u00e9mon goes inside an ally Dondozo if one is on the field and raises all its stats sharply. Raises the likelihood of Double Battles while this Pok\u00e9mon is on the field.\"},\"electromorphosis\":{\"name\":\"Electromorphosis\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon takes damage from a move, the power of the next Electric-type move used by the Pok\u00e9mon will be doubled.\"},\"protosynthesis\":{\"name\":\"Protosynthesis\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s most proficient stat in harsh sunlight by 30%, or 50% if the stat boosted is its Speed stat.\"},\"quarkDrive\":{\"name\":\"Quark Drive\",\"description\":\"Boosts the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s most proficient stat on Electric Terrain by 30%, or 50% if the stat boosted is its Speed stat.\"},\"goodAsGold\":{\"name\":\"Good as Gold\",\"description\":\"A body of pure, solid gold gives the Pok\u00e9mon full immunity to other Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s status moves.\"},\"vesselOfRuin\":{\"name\":\"Vessel of Ruin\",\"description\":\"The power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s ruinous vessel lowers the Sp. Atk stats of all Pok\u00e9mon except itself by 25% while on the field.\"},\"swordOfRuin\":{\"name\":\"Sword of Ruin\",\"description\":\"The power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s ruinous sword lowers the Defense stats of all Pok\u00e9mon except itself by 25% while on the field.\"},\"tabletsOfRuin\":{\"name\":\"Tablets of Ruin\",\"description\":\"The power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s ruinous wooden tablets lowers the Attack stats of all Pok\u00e9mon except itself by 25% while on the field.\"},\"beadsOfRuin\":{\"name\":\"Beads of Ruin\",\"description\":\"The power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s ruinous beads lowers the Sp. Def stats of all Pok\u00e9mon except itself by 25% while on the field.\"},\"orichalcumPulse\":{\"name\":\"Orichalcum Pulse\",\"description\":\"Summons harsh sunlight for 5 turns when entering a battle, which powers up Fire-type moves by 50% and halves the power of Water-type moves. The ancient pulse thrumming through the Pok\u00e9mon also boosts its Attack stat by 33% in harsh sunlight.\"},\"hadronEngine\":{\"name\":\"Hadron Engine\",\"description\":\"Turns the ground into Electric Terrain for 5 turns when entering a battle, which powers up the Electric-type moves of Pok\u00e9mon on the ground by 30% and prevents them from falling asleep. The futuristic engine within the Pok\u00e9mon also boosts its Sp. Atk stat by 33% on Electric Terrain.\"},\"opportunist\":{\"name\":\"Opportunist\",\"description\":\"When an opponent\u2019s stats are boosted, the Pok\u00e9mon seizes the opportunity to boost its own stats in the exact same way.\"},\"cudChew\":{\"name\":\"Cud Chew\",\"description\":\"If the Pok\u00e9mon eats a Berry, it will regurgitate and eat that same Berry once more at the end of next turn.\"},\"sharpness\":{\"name\":\"Sharpness\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s slicing moves by 50%.\"},\"supremeOverlord\":{\"name\":\"Supreme Overlord\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle, the power of its moves is boosted by 10% for each Pok\u00e9mon in its party that has been defeated in battle already. The maximum boost is 50%\"},\"costar\":{\"name\":\"Costar\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle, it copies its ally\u2019s stat changes.\"},\"toxicDebris\":{\"name\":\"Toxic Debris\",\"description\":\"Scatters poison spikes at the feet of the opposing team when the Pok\u00e9mon takes damage from physical moves. Opposing Pok\u00e9mon that land on these spikes when switching into battle will be poisoned. A second layer of spikes will instead badly poison. Poison-types that land on these spikes will absorb and remove them from the field.\"},\"armorTail\":{\"name\":\"Armor Tail\",\"description\":\"The mysterious tail covering the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s head makes opponents unable to use priority moves against the Pok\u00e9mon or its allies.\"},\"earthEater\":{\"name\":\"Earth Eater\",\"description\":\"Ground-type moves do not work on the Pok\u00e9mon. Instead, they restore \u00bc of its max HP.\"},\"myceliumMight\":{\"name\":\"Mycelium Might\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s status moves will go last among moves of the same priority, but these moves will be unaffected by the Ability of the target.\"},\"mindsEye\":{\"name\":\"Mind\u2019s Eye\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon ignores changes to opponents\u2019 evasiveness, its accuracy can\u2019t be lowered, and it can hit Ghost types with Normal- and Fighting-type moves.\"},\"supersweetSyrup\":{\"name\":\"Supersweet Syrup\",\"description\":\"A sickly sweet scent spreads across the field when the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle, lowering the evasiveness of opposing Pok\u00e9mon.\"},\"hospitality\":{\"name\":\"Hospitality\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle, it showers its ally with hospitality, restoring \u00bc of its ally\u2019s max HP.\"},\"toxicChain\":{\"name\":\"Toxic Chain\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon hits a target with a move, the target has a 30% chance of being badly poisoned from the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s toxic chain.\"},\"embodyAspectTeal\":{\"name\":\"Embody Aspect\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s heart fills with memories, causing the Teal Mask to shine and the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Speed stat to be boosted.\"},\"embodyAspectWellspring\":{\"name\":\"Embody Aspect\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s heart fills with memories, causing the Wellspring Mask to shine and the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Sp. Def stat to be boosted.\"},\"embodyAspectHearthflame\":{\"name\":\"Embody Aspect\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s heart fills with memories, causing the Hearthflame Mask to shine and the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Attack stat to be boosted.\"},\"embodyAspectCornerstone\":{\"name\":\"Embody Aspect\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s heart fills with memories, causing the Cornerstone Mask to shine and the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Defense stat to be boosted.\"},\"teraShift\":{\"name\":\"Tera Shift\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon enters a battle, it absorbs the energy around itself and transforms into its Terastal Form.\"},\"teraShell\":{\"name\":\"Tera Shell\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s shell contains the powers of each type. All damage-dealing moves that hit the Pok\u00e9mon when its HP is full will not be very effective.\"},\"teraformZero\":{\"name\":\"Teraform Zero\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon uses its hidden powers to eliminate all effects of weather and terrain, reducing them to zero.\"},\"poisonPuppeteer\":{\"name\":\"Poison Puppeteer\",\"description\":\"Pok\u00e9mon poisoned or badly poisoned by this Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s moves will also become confused.\"},\"piercingDrill\":{\"name\":\"Piercing Drill\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon uses contact moves, it can hit even targets that are protecting themselves, dealing \u00bc of the damage that the move would otherwise deal. Everything aside from the target\u2019s protective effects is still triggered.\"},\"dragonize\":{\"name\":\"Dragonize\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Normal-type moves become Dragon-type moves and their power is boosted by 20%.\"},\"eelevate\":{\"name\":\"Eelevate\",\"description\":\"The Pok\u00e9mon floats off the ground, making it immune to Ground-type moves, as well as Spikes, Toxic Spikes, and Sticky Web. When the Pok\u00e9mon knocks out a target with an attack, its highest stat is boosted by 1 stage.\"},\"megaSol\":{\"name\":\"Mega Sol\",\"description\":\"Even when the sunlight has not turned harsh, the Pok\u00e9mon can use its moves as if the weather were harsh sunlight.\"},\"fireMane\":{\"name\":\"Fire Mane\",\"description\":\"Boosts the power of the Pok\u00e9mon\u2019s Fire-type moves by 50%.\"},\"spicySpray\":{\"name\":\"Spicy Spray\",\"description\":\"When the Pok\u00e9mon takes damage from a move, it burns the attacker.\"},\"auraGuard\":{\"name\":\"Aura Guard\",\"description\":\"Halves the damage taken from moves that make direct contact.\"}}"},
